window.CARDS=window.CARDS||{};CARDS["story-v-y2v9-index"]=[{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p8-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"","w":"horikita-suzune nagumo-miyabi ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka the end of semester special exam  a cooperative written test summoned by nagumo to the student council room after school  chabashira announces the final special exam of the second semester   class a  sakayanagi  1250 pts  vs class b  horikita  985 pts  winner takes 50 class points from the loser  special rules  a cooperative written test done by one student at a time in a separate room  no rules to memorize  time bonus  10 pts hour remaining  and per question points  inversely  tied to oaa rating  a 1 pt   e 5 pts    so lower rated students score more per correct answer  a fixed number of questions are randomly  unanswerable   based on absences    zero points  dec 22 exam  dec 23 results  sees this as a  good chance of winning    class b s many lower oaa students  kei  sato  ike  shinohara  can now score 4 5 pts each  horikita grasps the possibility  notes class a still formidable in pure written exams and that 4 absent students would create 4 unanswerable questions  she leads the analysis    we have a good chance of winning  he summoned him    nagumo s message was so compelling that i had no choice but to accept it","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p8-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p8-1\">The end-of-semester special exam: a cooperative written test<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.8–17<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Summoned by Nagumo to the student council room after school; Chabashira announces the final special exam of the second semester — Class A (Sakayanagi, 1250 pts) vs Class B (Horikita, 985 pts), winner takes 50 class points from the loser.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Detail<\/span> Special rules: a cooperative written test done by one student at a time in a separate room; no rules to memorize; time bonus (10 pts/hour remaining), and per-question points *inversely* tied to OAA rating (A=1 pt ... E=5 pts) — so lower-rated students score more per correct answer; a fixed number of questions are randomly &quot;unanswerable&quot; (based on absences) — zero points; Dec 22 exam, Dec 23 results.<span class=\"pg\">p.13–15<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Sees this as a &quot;good chance of winning&quot; — Class B&#x27;s many lower-OAA students (Kei, Satō, Ike, Shinohara) can now score 4–5 pts each; Horikita grasps the possibility; notes Class A still formidable in pure written exams and that 4 absent students would create 4 unanswerable questions.<span class=\"pg\">p.14–17<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> She leads the analysis — &quot;we have a good chance of winning.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.14–17<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> He summoned him — &quot;Nagumo&#x27;s message was so compelling that I had no choice but to accept it.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.8, 18<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p18-1\">→ After: Nagumo&#x27;s election bet: 20 million points<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9-p8-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka karuizawa-kei","q":"karuizawa kei kei  bedhead in the morning  sulking at the study group runs breathless to meet ayanokoji outside the dorm  embarrassed by her bedhead and flustered when he points it out  she refuses to be compared to hondo and ike   sorry  kiyotaka   don t put me in the same category with those boys  ugh  i m going to go to the bathroom when i get to school  at the cafe study group she brightens at seeing him  but is visibly put out that he is only visiting briefly   oh  kiyotaka is here too  playful and appearance conscious  still openly affectionate toward ayanokoji  but sensitive to his attention  her boyfriend  runs to meet him in the morning and lights up at the study group","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9-p8-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html#sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9-p8-1\">Kei: bedhead in the morning, sulking at the study group<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.8–9, 69<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Runs breathless to meet Ayanokōji outside the dorm, embarrassed by her bedhead and flustered when he points it out; she refuses to be compared to Hondō and Ike. At the café study group she brightens at seeing him, but is visibly put out that he is only visiting briefly.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;Sorry, Kiyotaka!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.8<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;Don&#x27;t put me in the same category with those boys! Ugh, I&#x27;m going to go to the bathroom when I get to school…&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.9<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;Oh, Kiyotaka is here too!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.69<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Playful and appearance-conscious, still openly affectionate toward Ayanokōji, but sensitive to his attention.<span class=\"pg\">p.8–69<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Her boyfriend; runs to meet him in the morning and lights up at the study group.<span class=\"pg\">p.8–69<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9-p177-1\">→ After: Kei: &quot;it&#x27;s about time I forgave you&quot;<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kushida-kikyou-y2v9-p8-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune ayanokouji-kiyotaka kushida-kikyou","q":"kushida kikyo kushida  a morning glare  then recruited to the student council walking to school  she waves and smiles at ayanokoji  then flashes him a glare the moment she thinks no one is watching   the hit and run he can t account for  horikita approaches her outside the classroom with the offer to fill ichinose s vacated student council seat  kushida probes who will be president  then agrees   is nagumo still going to be the student council president   what  i see  was there a problem  two faced as ever   friendly in public  openly hostile when unobserved  she is flattered and surprised to be hand picked by horikita despite their friction  like oil and water  yet horikita needs her high reputation and b  academics  she accepts the seat  glared at him when she thought no one saw","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kushida-kikyou-y2v9-p8-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kushida-kikyou.html#sc-kushida-kikyou-y2v9-p8-1\">Kushida: a morning glare, then recruited to the student council<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.8, 46–49<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kushida-kikyou.html\">Kushida Kikyō<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Walking to school, she waves and smiles at Ayanokōji, then flashes him a glare the moment she thinks no one is watching — the hit-and-run he can&#x27;t account for. Horikita approaches her outside the classroom with the offer to fill Ichinose&#x27;s vacated student-council seat; Kushida probes who will be president, then agrees.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> &quot;Is Nagumo still going to be the student council president?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.46<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> &quot;What...? I see. Was there a problem?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Two-faced as ever — friendly in public, openly hostile when unobserved; she is flattered and surprised to be hand-picked by Horikita despite their friction.<span class=\"pg\">p.8, 46–49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Like oil and water, yet Horikita needs her high reputation and B+ academics; she accepts the seat.<span class=\"pg\">p.46–49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Glared at him when she thought no one saw.<span class=\"pg\">p.8<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kushida-kikyou-y2v9-p73-1\">→ After: Kushida: sworn in, then secretary on the shoplifting case<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hondou-ryoutaro-y2v9-p9-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"","w":"hondou-ryoutaro","q":"hondo ryotaro hondo  named in kei s morning comparison named only   ayanokoji tells kei that hondo and ike have worse sleeping habits than her bedhead  as she fusses over her hair walking to school","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hondou-ryoutaro-y2v9-p9-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/hondou-ryoutaro.html#sc-hondou-ryoutaro-y2v9-p9-1\">Hondō: named in Kei&#x27;s morning comparison<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.9<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/hondou-ryoutaro.html\">Hondō Ryōtaro<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named only — Ayanokōji tells Kei that Hondō and Ike have worse sleeping habits than her bedhead, as she fusses over her hair walking to school.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-chabashira-sae-y2v9-p10-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"chabashira-sae","q":"chabashira sae chabashira announces the final special exam of the semester she arrives for homeroom and tells class 1 d that before winter break they must take the last special exam of the second semester   an academic one on one match with no expulsion but a swing of 50 class points   it should come as no surprise to you that you didn t have any warning  but before winter break  you ll have to take the last special exam of the second semester   i understand your concerns  but there s no need to panic so much  it isn t the most feared kind of special exam that will cause students to drop out  she lays out the rules   a cooperative written test of 100 questions solved one at a time  points scored inversely to oaa academic rating  time bonuses  and unanswerable questions for absences   and insists the class has a real chance to win  calm  matter of fact instructor who downplays panic and frames the exam as class b s genuine opportunity  she spoke like a mother watching over her children","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-chabashira-sae-y2v9-p10-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/chabashira-sae.html#sc-chabashira-sae-y2v9-p10-1\">Chabashira announces the final special exam of the semester<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.10–15<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She arrives for homeroom and tells Class 1-D that before winter break they must take the last special exam of the second semester — an academic one-on-one match with no expulsion but a swing of 50 class points. She lays out the rules — a cooperative written test of 100 questions solved one at a time, points scored inversely to OAA academic rating, time bonuses, and unanswerable questions for absences — and insists the class has a real chance to win.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> &quot;It should come as no surprise to you that you didn&#x27;t have any warning, but before winter break, you&#x27;ll have to take the last special exam of the second semester.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.10<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> &quot;I understand your concerns, but there&#x27;s no need to panic so much. It isn&#x27;t the most feared kind of special exam that will cause students to drop out.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.11<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Calm, matter-of-fact instructor who downplays panic and frames the exam as Class B&#x27;s genuine opportunity; she spoke like a mother watching over her children.<span class=\"pg\">p.10–15<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hirata-yousuke-y2v9-p10-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka hirata-yousuke","q":"hirata yosuke hirata  still watching over ayanokoji after the group split in the classroom  surrounded by girls  he greets ayanokoji and repeats his standing offer to help with the fallout of leaving the group   this may be none of my business  but if there s anything i can do to help you  please let me know   that s no good  i can t stand it when i see instability in the class  persistent  guilt driven caretaker   he keeps checking in daily about ayanokoji s standing with the old group and can t tolerate unresolved instability  even though he has done nothing wrong  repeatedly offers help  ayanokoji asks him to watch over things quietly","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hirata-yousuke-y2v9-p10-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html#sc-hirata-yousuke-y2v9-p10-1\">Hirata: still watching over Ayanokōji after the group split<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.10<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">In the classroom, surrounded by girls, he greets Ayanokōji and repeats his standing offer to help with the fallout of leaving the group.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> &quot;This may be none of my business, but if there&#x27;s anything I can do to help you, please let me know.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.10<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> &quot;That&#x27;s no good. I can&#x27;t stand it when I see instability in the class…&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.10<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Persistent, guilt-driven caretaker — he keeps checking in daily about Ayanokōji&#x27;s standing with the old group and can&#x27;t tolerate unresolved instability, even though he has done nothing wrong.<span class=\"pg\">p.10<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Repeatedly offers help; Ayanokōji asks him to watch over things quietly.<span class=\"pg\">p.10<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ike-kanji-y2v9-p11-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ike-kanji","q":"ike kanji ike  the exam brief and the cafe study group in homeroom  on hearing class b must fight class a in the academic match  he objects that it is a bad idea   so  if it s a class based academic competition  then it s simply not a good idea to fight against class a  at the cafe study group he arrives late  claims he is also trying  but shinohara s comparison to sudo s progress silences his argument   oh  i m trying  too  still the loud  defensive class clown  but now making a visible effort at the study groups   though he bristles when his girlfriend measures him against sudo s growth","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ike-kanji-y2v9-p11-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html#sc-ike-kanji-y2v9-p11-1\">Ike: the exam brief and the café study group<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.11, 69–70<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">In homeroom, on hearing Class B must fight Class A in the academic match, he objects that it is a bad idea. At the café study group he arrives late, claims he is also trying, but Shinohara&#x27;s comparison to Sudō&#x27;s progress silences his argument.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> &quot;So, if it&#x27;s a class-based academic competition, then it&#x27;s simply not a good idea to fight against Class A!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.11<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> &quot;Oh, I&#x27;m trying, too!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.69<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Still the loud, defensive class clown, but now making a visible effort at the study groups — though he bristles when his girlfriend measures him against Sudō&#x27;s growth.<span class=\"pg\">p.11, 69–70<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ike-kanji-y2v9-p141-1\">→ After: Ike: the lunch study grind with Shinohara<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-wang-mei-yu-y2v9-p17-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"","w":"wang-mei-yu","q":"wang mei yu wang  mii chan  mentioned in passing named in the study session context    keisei and mii chan  named    yousuke  mii chan  and horikita must ve seemed like naturally born geniuses  named    mii chan  who was teaching sonoda  gave her a soft pep talk  passing mentions  mii chan is present in the study group but not in a distinct scene of her own","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-wang-mei-yu-y2v9-p17-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/wang-mei-yu.html#sc-wang-mei-yu-y2v9-p17-1\">Wang (Mii-chan) mentioned in passing<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.17, 70, 141<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/wang-mei-yu.html\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in the study session context — &quot;Keisei and Mii-chan.&quot; Named — &quot;Yousuke, Mii-chan, and Horikita must&#x27;ve seemed like naturally-born geniuses.&quot; Named — &quot;Mii-chan, who was teaching Sonoda, gave her a soft pep talk.&quot;<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mentions; Mii-chan is present in the study group but not in a distinct scene of her own.<span class=\"pg\">p.17, 70, 141<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p18-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"nagumo-miyabi kiriyama ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka nagumo s election bet  20 million points in the student council room  nagumo and kiriyama reveal they ve called horikita and ichinose   nagumo will step down and hold an election for the next student council president   if i win  i want to get some private points from you   if you re fine with paying ayanokouji  nagumo proposes they pick the next president together and bet   if ayanokoji wins  he gets enough private points to  buy a ticket to move to the next class   20 million  the third year votes are at nagumo s discretion  1 3 already his  ayanokoji recognizes nagumo s  conscience  and refuses to be outdone   accepts the high stakes match  he wants a  battle  to decide the president  they bet 20 million points on the outcome   the  match  ayanokoji wanted  the vice president   watches silently  urges nagumo to be pragmatic","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p18-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p18-1\">Nagumo&#x27;s election bet: 20 million points<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.18–25<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">In the student council room, Nagumo and Kiriyama reveal they&#x27;ve called Horikita and Ichinose — Nagumo will step down and hold an election for the next student council president.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kiriyama.html\">Kiriyama<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;If I win, I want to get some private points from you.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.24<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;If you&#x27;re fine with paying Ayanokouji&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.25<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Nagumo proposes they pick the next president together and bet — if Ayanokōji wins, he gets enough private points to &quot;buy a ticket to move to the next class&quot; (20 million); the third-year votes are at Nagumo&#x27;s discretion (1/3 already his); Ayanokōji recognizes Nagumo&#x27;s &quot;conscience&quot; and refuses to be outdone — accepts the high-stakes match.<span class=\"pg\">p.18–25<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> He wants a &quot;battle&quot; to decide the president; they bet 20 million points on the outcome — the &quot;match&quot; Ayanokōji wanted.<span class=\"pg\">p.18–25<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama<\/b> The vice president — watches silently, urges Nagumo to be pragmatic.<span class=\"pg\">p.18–25<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p8-1\">← Before: The end-of-semester special exam: a cooperative written test<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p26-1\">→ After: Ichinose withdraws; Horikita becomes president unopposed<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-nagumo-miyabi-y2v9-p18-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka kiryuin-fuuka ichinose-honami nagumo-miyabi","q":"nagumo miyabi nagumo  his final act as president  exposed by kiryuin  if i win  i want to get some private points from you   i m sorry for interrupting  but i want to talk about what you said earlier    kiryuin  it was impossible to replace honami now   you re a student in suzune s class  please help me gather members for the student council  steps down as president  arranging an election between horikita and ichinose  with 1 3 of votes at his discretion  and betting 20 million points with ayanokoji   but kiryuin publicly exposes that he ordered first year yamanaka to shoplift as a  mission  he refuses to acknowledge it  no evidence  but ichinose s withdrawal ends his  match  he hands the presidency to an unopposed horikita  tasks her  and ayanokoji  with recruiting  and accepts hokkaido souvenirs    you re very disciplined in a strange way  he loses his 20 million point bet  ichinose withdrew  but still ropes him into helping recruit  she bursts in and exposes the shoplifting order   he tries to  make a pass  at her but she s unmoved   you are full of faults  but i appreciate what you said  he wanted her in the election  i don t get it    her withdrawal frustrates him  damn it","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-nagumo-miyabi-y2v9-p18-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html#sc-nagumo-miyabi-y2v9-p18-1\">Nagumo: his final act as president; exposed by Kiryūin<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.18–38<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kiryuin-fuuka.html\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> &quot;If I win, I want to get some private points from you.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.24<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;m sorry for interrupting, but I want to talk about what you said earlier.&quot; — Kiryūin<span class=\"pg\">p.33<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> &quot;It was impossible to replace Honami now.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.35<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;You&#x27;re a student in Suzune&#x27;s class. Please help me gather members for the student council.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.36<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Steps down as president, arranging an election between Horikita and Ichinose (with 1/3 of votes at his discretion) and betting 20 million points with Ayanokōji — but Kiryūin publicly exposes that he ordered first-year Yamanaka to shoplift as a &quot;mission&quot;; he refuses to acknowledge it (no evidence), but Ichinose&#x27;s withdrawal ends his &quot;match&quot;; he hands the presidency to an unopposed Horikita, tasks her (and Ayanokōji) with recruiting, and accepts Hokkaido souvenirs — &quot;You&#x27;re very disciplined in a strange way.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.18–38<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> He loses his 20-million-point bet (Ichinose withdrew) but still ropes him into helping recruit.<span class=\"pg\">p.24–37<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/b> She bursts in and exposes the shoplifting order — he tries to &quot;make a pass&quot; at her but she&#x27;s unmoved; &quot;You are full of faults, but I appreciate what you said.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.29–33<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> He wanted her in the election (&quot;I don&#x27;t get it&quot;) — her withdrawal frustrates him (&quot;Damn it…&quot;).<span class=\"pg\">p.33–35<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-nagumo-miyabi-y2v9-p74-1\">→ After: Nagumo&#x27;s farewell: regrets at the handover<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p26-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami horikita-suzune kiryuin-fuuka nagumo-miyabi ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka ichinose withdraws  horikita becomes president unopposed horikita and ichinose arrive  kiryuin bursts in  revealing nagumo ordered first year yamanaka to shoplift as a  mission   a way to be expelled gain class a tickets    yamanaka s lie would only punish herself  no evidence against nagumo   i m not going to run for the student council this time   a person like me can t be the student council president  a criminal  that s why   before the election  i would like to resign from the student council today   i m sure you ll be a wonderful student council president  horikita san  watches as ichinose   shaken by kiryuin s  criminal  remark  her shoplifting past    withdraws from the election and resigns from the student council entirely  believing her own  conceitedness  caused her class s fall  horikita  unopposed  becomes president and is ordered to recruit new members  one second year  one first year to replace yagami  ayanokoji is roped into helping  he gives nagumo hokkaido souvenirs   nagumo calls him  disciplined in a strange way  she withdraws and resigns  calling herself a  criminal    ayanokoji can t explain the shoplifting context  she departs smiling  rooting for horikita  she becomes student council president unopposed  tasked with recruiting   ayanokoji agrees to help  she bursts in and exposes nagumo s shoplifting order    i m sorry for interrupting  but i want to talk about what you said earlier  he loses his  match   ichinose s withdrawal ends it  tells ayanokoji to help recruit  and accepts souvenirs","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p26-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p26-1\">Ichinose withdraws; Horikita becomes president unopposed<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.26–37<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Horikita and Ichinose arrive; Kiryūin bursts in, revealing Nagumo ordered first-year Yamanaka to shoplift as a &quot;mission&quot; (a way to be expelled/gain Class A tickets) — Yamanaka&#x27;s lie would only punish herself (no evidence against Nagumo).<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kiryuin-fuuka.html\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;m—not going to run for the student council this time.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.33<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;a person like me can&#x27;t be the student council president. A criminal, that&#x27;s why…&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.33<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Before the election, I would like to resign from the student council today.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.34<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;m sure you&#x27;ll be a wonderful student council president, Horikita-san.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.35<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Watches as Ichinose — shaken by Kiryūin&#x27;s &quot;criminal&quot; remark (her shoplifting past) — withdraws from the election and resigns from the student council entirely, believing her own &quot;conceitedness&quot; caused her class&#x27;s fall; Horikita, unopposed, becomes president and is ordered to recruit new members (one second-year, one first-year to replace Yagami); Ayanokōji is roped into helping; he gives Nagumo Hokkaido souvenirs — Nagumo calls him &quot;disciplined in a strange way.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.26–37<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> She withdraws and resigns, calling herself a &quot;criminal&quot; — Ayanokōji can&#x27;t explain the shoplifting context; she departs smiling, rooting for Horikita.<span class=\"pg\">p.33–35<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> She becomes student council president unopposed; tasked with recruiting — Ayanokōji agrees to help.<span class=\"pg\">p.35–37<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/b> She bursts in and exposes Nagumo&#x27;s shoplifting order — &quot;I&#x27;m sorry for interrupting, but I want to talk about what you said earlier.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.29–33<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> He loses his &quot;match&quot; (Ichinose&#x27;s withdrawal ends it), tells Ayanokōji to help recruit, and accepts souvenirs.<span class=\"pg\">p.36–38<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p18-1\">← Before: Nagumo&#x27;s election bet: 20 million points<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p44-1\">→ After: Recruiting Kushida: Horikita&#x27;s prostration gambit<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v9-p26-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami nagumo-miyabi ayanokouji-kiyotaka horikita-suzune","q":"horikita suzune horikita  endorsing ichinose  becoming student council president  i believe that ichinose san would be a good choice for student council president  i don t think she has any faults   i m perfectly fine with it being ichinose san   ichinose san has left the student council  what should i do   i ll do my best    on recruiting two new members freely endorses ichinose for president  she never wanted the role herself  when ichinose withdraws and resigns  she s unopposed and becomes president  nagumo orders her to fill the vacancies  one second year  one first year for yagami    she accepts without hesitation  and ayanokoji agrees to help  she endorses her  then is surprised by her withdrawal    ichinose san  he handovers the presidency and assigns her the recruitment task  he s roped in to help recruit    it looks like we ve come to an agreement","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v9-p26-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html#sc-horikita-suzune-y2v9-p26-1\">Horikita: endorsing Ichinose; becoming student council president<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.26–37<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;I believe that Ichinose-san would be a good choice for student council president. I don&#x27;t think she has any faults.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.27<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;m perfectly fine with it being Ichinose-san.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.27<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;Ichinose-san has left the student council, what should I do?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.35<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;ll do my best.&quot; — on recruiting two new members<span class=\"pg\">p.36<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Freely endorses Ichinose for president (she never wanted the role herself); when Ichinose withdraws and resigns, she&#x27;s unopposed and becomes president; Nagumo orders her to fill the vacancies (one second-year, one first-year for Yagami) — she accepts without hesitation, and Ayanokōji agrees to help.<span class=\"pg\">p.26–37<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> She endorses her, then is surprised by her withdrawal — &quot;Ichinose-san…&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.27, 34<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> He handovers the presidency and assigns her the recruitment task.<span class=\"pg\">p.35–37<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> He&#x27;s roped in to help recruit — &quot;It looks like we&#x27;ve come to an agreement.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.37<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiriyama-ikuto-y2v9-p26-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"nagumo-miyabi ayanokouji-kiyotaka kiriyama-ikuto","q":"kiriyama ikuto kiriyama  the 20 million point bet and his last stand as nagumo and ayanokoji finalize the bet on the student council election  kiriyama makes a final attempt to stop a game staking 20 million points and ayanokoji s expulsion   i ll get you the contract  it s one of two things  expulsion or 20 million   you don t have to risk your expulsion to play along with nagumo s game  he tries to warn horikita that ayanokoji has been drawn into something  but nagumo talks over him  and he is left holding his forehead   wait a minute  president  ayanokouji kun is here because  the pragmatic vice president   deeply uneasy about the stakes and the hidden bet  unable to rein in nagumo  and worried about ayanokoji being drawn in  his president  he cannot stop his impulsive high stakes game  tries to warn him off the gamble  notes he no longer hides his true nature","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiriyama-ikuto-y2v9-p26-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kiriyama-ikuto.html#sc-kiriyama-ikuto-y2v9-p26-1\">Kiriyama: the 20-million-point bet and his last stand<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.26–28<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kiriyama-ikuto.html\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">As Nagumo and Ayanokōji finalize the bet on the student-council election, Kiriyama makes a final attempt to stop a game staking 20 million points and Ayanokōji&#x27;s expulsion. He tries to warn Horikita that Ayanokōji has been drawn into something, but Nagumo talks over him, and he is left holding his forehead.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;ll get you the contract. It&#x27;s one of two things: expulsion or 20 million.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.26<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/b> &quot;You don&#x27;t have to risk your expulsion to play along with Nagumo&#x27;s game.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.26<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/b> &quot;Wait a minute, President. Ayanokouji-kun is here because...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.28<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> The pragmatic vice president — deeply uneasy about the stakes and the hidden bet, unable to rein in Nagumo, and worried about Ayanokōji being drawn in.<span class=\"pg\">p.26–28<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> His president; he cannot stop his impulsive high-stakes game.<span class=\"pg\">p.26–28<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Tries to warn him off the gamble; notes he no longer hides his true nature.<span class=\"pg\">p.26<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kiriyama-ikuto-y2v9-p75-1\">→ After: Kiriyama: inauguration, then exposed as the shoplifting mastermind<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9-p29-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"nagumo-miyabi kiriyama-ikuto ichinose-honami kiryuin-fuuka","q":"kiryuin fuuka kiryuin interrupts the election meeting she enters the student council room without knocking to press an appointment she says kiriyama made with her  and refuses nagumo s attempt to put her off   going so far as to put her foot on an empty chair   let me interrupt you  nagumo   i refuse  blunt  impatient and confrontational   she ignores protocol  refuses to wait quietly  and is undeterred by the president  she brushes off his demand that she wait  he calls her an unexpected guest  says he had agreed to make time for her  she lays out the accusation   that yamanaka  a third year class d student  tried to slip lipstick into her bag at keyaki mall and blamed nagumo   and offers to drop the matter if nagumo apologizes   you don t understand me well enough to say  it s not like me  unfortunately  i have a great dislike for acts like shoplifting   you can rest assured  if i can hear an apology from you  i promise you that this matter will be put to rest  unaware of ichinose s shoplifting past  she speaks bluntly about her hatred of the act  when nagumo refuses and walks away  she is stunned  her blunt talk of shoplifting darkens ichinose s expression   unknowingly striking a nerve","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9-p29-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kiryuin-fuuka.html#sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9-p29-1\">Kiryūin interrupts the election meeting<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.29–30<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kiryuin-fuuka.html\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She enters the student-council room without knocking to press an appointment she says Kiriyama made with her, and refuses Nagumo&#x27;s attempt to put her off — going so far as to put her foot on an empty chair. She lays out the accusation — that Yamanaka, a third-year Class D student, tried to slip lipstick into her bag at Keyaki Mall and blamed Nagumo — and offers to drop the matter if Nagumo apologizes.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kiriyama-ikuto.html\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/b> &quot;Let me interrupt you, Nagumo.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/b> &quot;I refuse.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/b> &quot;You don&#x27;t understand me well enough to say &#x27;it&#x27;s not like me.&#x27; Unfortunately, I have a great dislike for acts like shoplifting.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.32<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Blunt, impatient and confrontational — she ignores protocol, refuses to wait quietly, and is undeterred by the president.<span class=\"pg\">p.29–30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> She brushes off his demand that she wait; he calls her an unexpected guest.<span class=\"pg\">p.29–30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/b> Says he had agreed to make time for her.<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;You can rest assured. If I can hear an apology from you, I promise you that this matter will be put to rest.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.32<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Unaware of Ichinose&#x27;s shoplifting past, she speaks bluntly about her hatred of the act; when Nagumo refuses and walks away, she is stunned.<span class=\"pg\">p.31–32<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Her blunt talk of shoplifting darkens Ichinose&#x27;s expression — unknowingly striking a nerve.<span class=\"pg\">p.32<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9-p76-1\">→ After: Kiryūin recruits Ayanokōji to investigate<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9-p33-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune nagumo-miyabi kiryuin-fuuka ichinose-honami","q":"ichinose honami ichinose withdraws  resigns from the student council  i m not going to run for the student council this time   i believe it s a problem that goes beyond that  i have always believed that belonging to the student council and becoming the student council president was for my own good and for the good of those around me  but now i realize that it was just my own conceitedness   a person like me can t be the student council president  a criminal  that s why   before the election  i would like to resign from the student council today   i m sorry i couldn t help you until the end   i m sure you ll be a wonderful student council president  horikita san  i ll be rooting for you  shaken by kiryuin s  criminal  remark  her shoplifting past  unknown to kiryuin but known to her  she withdraws from the election and resigns from the student council   not a spur of the moment choice  something i ve been thinking about since a little before the trip  blames her own  conceitedness  for her class s fall from class a  and leaves smiling  rooting for horikita  she endorses her as the next president    i ll be rooting for you  she declines his election    i apologize for not being able to live up to your expectations  kiryuin s  shoplifter criminal  remark deeply affects her    no matter how much time passes  the sins of the past will not disappear","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9-p33-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html#sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9-p33-1\">Ichinose withdraws; resigns from the student council<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.33–35<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kiryuin-fuuka.html\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;m—not going to run for the student council this time.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.33<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;I believe it&#x27;s a problem that goes beyond that. I have always believed that belonging to the student council and becoming the student council president was for my own good and for the good of those around me. But now I realize…<span class=\"pg\">p.33<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;a person like me can&#x27;t be the student council president. A criminal, that&#x27;s why…&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.33<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>8 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I believe it&#x27;s a problem that goes beyond that. I have always believed that belonging to the student council and becoming the student council president was for my own good and for the good of those around me. But now I realize that it was just my own conceitedness.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.33<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Before the election, I would like to resign from the student council today.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.34<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;m sorry I couldn&#x27;t help you until the end.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.34<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;m sure you&#x27;ll be a wonderful student council president, Horikita-san. I&#x27;ll be rooting for you.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.35<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Shaken by Kiryūin&#x27;s &quot;criminal&quot; remark (her shoplifting past, unknown to Kiryūin but known to her), she withdraws from the election and resigns from the student council — not a spur-of-the-moment choice (&quot;something I&#x27;ve been thinking about since a little before the trip&quot;); blames her own &quot;conceitedness&quot; for her class&#x27;s fall from Class A, and leaves smiling, rooting for Horikita.<span class=\"pg\">p.33–35<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> She endorses her as the next president — &quot;I&#x27;ll be rooting for you.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.35<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> She declines his election — &quot;I apologize for not being able to live up to your expectations.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.33–35<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/b> Kiryūin&#x27;s &quot;shoplifter&quot;/&quot;criminal&quot; remark deeply affects her — &quot;No matter how much time passes, the sins of the past will not disappear.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.33<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9-p118-1\">→ After: Ichinose: the &quot;mirror your day off&quot; gym date and café talk<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-yagami-takuya-y2v9-p36-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"","w":"yagami-takuya","q":"yagami takuya yagami mentioned in passing named   nagumo orders horikita to appoint a first year student council member   yagami unexpectedly dropped out of school  named   there was still a vacancy with yagami leaving  named    yagami kun this year  in the context of students applying to join the student council  passing mentions  yagami is not present in any scene","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-yagami-takuya-y2v9-p36-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/yagami-takuya.html#sc-yagami-takuya-y2v9-p36-1\">Yagami mentioned in passing<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.36, 61, 65–66<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/yagami-takuya.html\">Yagami Takuya<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named — Nagumo orders Horikita to appoint a first-year student council member; &quot;Yagami unexpectedly dropped out of school.&quot; Named — &quot;Yagami-kun this year&quot; in the context of students applying to join the student council.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Named — there was still a vacancy with Yagami leaving.<span class=\"pg\">p.61<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mentions; Yagami is not present in any scene.<span class=\"pg\">p.36, 61, 65–66<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p44-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune kushida-kikyou amasawa-ichika ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka recruiting kushida  horikita s prostration gambit as new student council president  horikita sets out to fill the vacancies  one second year  one first year  she approaches kushida   a  skilled  high reputation candidate   though they are  oil and water   yes  if you show me a  please  kushida san  attitude  i will consider it  no  i will definitely join the student council   so  just prostrate myself and ask you to join the student council    horikita watches as horikita corners kushida  in front of witnesses  so she can t drop the  good girl  facade  then takes the negotiation private  special wing  when kushida demands horikita prostrate herself  horikita actually starts to kneel   ayanokoji notes the vice president has more real power than the student council president  appealing to kushida s ambition  to make the president her  plaything  kushida finally agrees   but only because it benefits her  and she still wants to see horikita prostrate herself  she uses ayanokoji s tactics    i m sure i won t get any compliments from nagumo  but i m so happy to    and nearly humiliates herself to recruit kushida  she resists joining  hates working under horikita  demands prostration  and accepts for her own benefit    three times more annoying  than horikita  she appeared eavesdropping on the kushida negotiation  claiming she came to see kushida  teased kushida  i m the only one who can tease kushida senpai so blatantly    ayanokoji suspects she wanted to see him horikita interact","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p44-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p44-1\">Recruiting Kushida: Horikita&#x27;s prostration gambit<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.44–59<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">As new student council president, Horikita sets out to fill the vacancies (one second-year, one first-year); she approaches Kushida — a &quot;skilled,&quot; high-reputation candidate — though they are &quot;oil and water.&quot;<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kushida-kikyou.html\">Kushida Kikyō<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/amasawa-ichika.html\">Amasawa Ichika<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Yes. If you show me a &#x27;please, Kushida-san&#x27; attitude, I will consider it… No, I will definitely join the student council!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.54<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;So… just prostrate myself and ask you to join the student council?&quot; — Horikita<span class=\"pg\">p.55<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Watches as Horikita corners Kushida (in front of witnesses, so she can&#x27;t drop the &quot;good girl&quot; facade), then takes the negotiation private (special wing); when Kushida demands Horikita prostrate herself, Horikita actually starts to kneel — Ayanokōji notes the vice president has more real power than the student council president, appealing to Kushida&#x27;s ambition (to make the president her &quot;plaything&quot;); Kushida finally agrees — but only because it benefits her, and she still wants to see Horikita prostrate herself.<span class=\"pg\">p.44–59<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> She uses Ayanokōji&#x27;s tactics — &quot;I&#x27;m sure I won&#x27;t get any compliments from Nagumo, but I&#x27;m so happy to...&quot; — and nearly humiliates herself to recruit Kushida.<span class=\"pg\">p.44–59<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> She resists joining (hates working under Horikita), demands prostration, and accepts for her own benefit — &quot;three times more annoying [than Horikita].&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.44–59<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Amasawa Ichika<\/b> She appeared eavesdropping on the Kushida negotiation (claiming she came to see Kushida), teased Kushida (&quot;I&#x27;m the only one who can tease Kushida-senpai so blatantly&quot;) — Ayanokōji suspects she wanted to see him/Horikita interact.<span class=\"pg\">p.48–60<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p26-1\">← Before: Ichinose withdraws; Horikita becomes president unopposed<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p61-1\">→ After: Recruiting Nanase; Ishigami declines<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-sakura-airi-y2v9-p44-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"","w":"sakura-airi","q":"sakura airi sakura mentioned in the study group context named in horikita s speech   she references sakura san s withdrawal as mental pressure on the class  passing mention only  not a scene presence","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-sakura-airi-y2v9-p44-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/sakura-airi.html#sc-sakura-airi-y2v9-p44-1\">Sakura mentioned in the study group context<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.44<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/sakura-airi.html\">Sakura Airi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in Horikita&#x27;s speech — she references Sakura-san&#x27;s withdrawal as mental pressure on the class.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mention only; not a scene presence.<span class=\"pg\">p.44<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-amasawa-ichika-y2v9-p60-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"kushida-kikyou horikita-suzune ishigami-kyo-1a amasawa-ichika","q":"amasawa ichika amasawa  trailing the council recruitment  teasing kushida she tags along as horikita recruits the first year ishigami  while waiting she explains to ayanokoji that she came to see how kushida was doing after their contact at the festival   to be honest  i came to see how kushida senpai was doing  you know  we had a little bit of forced contact at the festival  so i was just wondering how things were going   i m the only one who can tease kushida senpai so blatantly  i wanted to check how mentally strong she is   simple curiosity  she admits she had considered joining the council but sees no point now  ayanokoji ties this to yagami s expulsion and her earlier hint about retracting her vow of no trouble  playful and calculating   openly enjoys needling kushida  follows the recruitment out of curiosity about the new president  and drops loaded hints about her intentions toward ayanokoji  teases her bluntly to gauge her mental strength after the festival  observes the new president closely  calls her serious  interesting and unique  her class a classmate  identifies him as the class s strategist","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-amasawa-ichika-y2v9-p60-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/amasawa-ichika.html#sc-amasawa-ichika-y2v9-p60-1\">Amasawa: trailing the council recruitment, teasing Kushida<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.60–67<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/amasawa-ichika.html\">Amasawa Ichika<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She tags along as Horikita recruits the first-year Ishigami; while waiting she explains to Ayanokōji that she came to see how Kushida was doing after their contact at the festival. She admits she had considered joining the council but sees no point now; Ayanokōji ties this to Yagami&#x27;s expulsion and her earlier hint about retracting her vow of no trouble.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/kushida-kikyou.html\">Kushida Kikyō<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/index.html#ishigami-kyo-1a\">Ishigami Kyō (Class 1-A)<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Amasawa Ichika<\/b> &quot;To be honest, I came to see how Kushida-senpai was doing. You know, we had a little bit of forced contact at the festival, so I was just wondering how things were going.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.60<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Amasawa Ichika<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;m the only one who can tease Kushida-senpai so blatantly. I wanted to check how mentally strong she is.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.60<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Amasawa Ichika<\/b> &quot;Simple curiosity.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.61<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Playful and calculating — openly enjoys needling Kushida, follows the recruitment out of curiosity about the new president, and drops loaded hints about her intentions toward Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.60–67<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> Teases her bluntly to gauge her mental strength after the festival.<span class=\"pg\">p.60<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Observes the new president closely, calls her serious, interesting and unique.<span class=\"pg\">p.61<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishigami Kyō (Class 1-A)<\/b> Her Class A classmate; identifies him as the class&#x27;s strategist.<span class=\"pg\">p.61<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p61-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"","w":"ishigami-kyo-1a nanase-tsubasa amasawa-ichika ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka recruiting nanase  ishigami declines horikita targets first year ishigami  class a  for the council   ayanokoji feigns ignorance  ishigami  polished honor student  declines   i have no interest in club activities nor in joining the student council  turns to class 1 d  where nanase volunteers  ayanokoji recommends her  good academic rating  serious  and horikita accepts pending nagumo s approval   nanase joins the student council  a  most welcome addition  given her hidden agenda to keep him at school  horikita asks him to join  he refuses outright   ayanokoji notes he s the one kanzaki warned about  she volunteers for the student council   ayanokoji has doubts about her true motive but sees the benefit  she s acquainted with ishigami  kushida senpai s  knows of him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p61-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p61-1\">Recruiting Nanase; Ishigami declines<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.61–67<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Horikita targets first-year Ishigami (Class A) for the council — Ayanokōji feigns ignorance; Ishigami (polished honor student) declines: &quot;I have no interest in club activities nor in joining the student council.&quot;<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/index.html#ishigami-kyo-1a\">Ishigami Kyō (Class 1-A)<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nanase-tsubasa.html\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/amasawa-ichika.html\">Amasawa Ichika<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Turns to Class 1-D, where Nanase volunteers; Ayanokōji recommends her (good academic rating, serious), and Horikita accepts pending Nagumo&#x27;s approval — Nanase joins the student council (a &quot;most welcome addition&quot; given her hidden agenda to keep him at school).<span class=\"pg\">p.61–67<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishigami Kyō (Class 1-A)<\/b> Horikita asks him to join; he refuses outright — Ayanokōji notes he&#x27;s the one Kanzaki warned about.<span class=\"pg\">p.61–65<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/b> She volunteers for the student council — Ayanokōji has doubts about her true motive but sees the benefit.<span class=\"pg\">p.66–67<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Amasawa Ichika<\/b> She&#x27;s acquainted with Ishigami (&quot;Kushida-senpai&#x27;s...&quot;), knows of him.<span class=\"pg\">p.61<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p44-1\">← Before: Recruiting Kushida: Horikita&#x27;s prostration gambit<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p118-1\">→ After: The gym date with Ichinose; her changed feelings<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ishigami-kyo-1a-y2v9-p61-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune amasawa-ichika ayanokouji-kiyotaka ishigami-kyo-1a","q":"ishigami kyo  class 1 a  first year class a ishigami  horikita s student council recruit declines horikita has been talking with first year students  ayanokoji asks who she was meeting and she names  ishigami kun  the only first year with that surname   amasawa  his classmate  knows him and calls him class a s de facto strategist rather than its leader  horikita praises him as academically sound with his classmates  trust  they find him in a small circle of boys by the entrance hall  and he turns to a silent stare at being called  showing no agitation and seeming oblivious to ayanokoji s presence   can i help you   it s fine  horikita senpai  but why me  horikita explains she has few first year contacts and values his oaa standing  he uses honorifics and none of the sass he shows ayanokoji   i m sorry  but i m not interested in joining   i have no interest in club activities nor in joining the student council   please look elsewhere  he turns his back and walks away  horikita considers stopping him but realizes she cannot force the council on him  calm  polite to upperclassmen  and single minded   refuses horikita s student council invitation instantly and without hesitation  horikita decides she cannot force him  and ayanokoji notes such motivated students would have applied earlier  she invites him to the student council  he declines courteously with  horikita senpai  his class a classmate  who recognizes him and describes him as the class s strategist  he meets ayanokoji s gaze with a silent stare and shows no sign of agitation at the unexpected first meeting  ayanokoji notes the class d option is also an easy solution  given that she d been turned down by ishigami","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ishigami-kyo-1a-y2v9-p61-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">First-year Class A Ishigami: Horikita&#x27;s student-council recruit declines<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.61–66<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/index.html#ishigami-kyo-1a\">Ishigami Kyō (Class 1-A)<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Horikita has been talking with first-year students; Ayanokōji asks who she was meeting and she names &quot;Ishigami-kun,&quot; the only first-year with that surname — Amasawa, his classmate, knows him and calls him Class A&#x27;s de facto strategist rather than its leader. Horikita praises him as academically sound with his classmates&#x27; trust; they find him in a small circle of boys by the entrance hall, and he turns to a silent stare at being called, showing no agitation and seeming oblivious to Ayanokōji&#x27;s presence. Horikita explains she has few first-year contacts and values his OAA standing; he uses honorifics and none of the sass he shows Ayanokōji. He turns his back and walks away; Horikita considers stopping him but realizes she cannot force the council on him.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/amasawa-ichika.html\">Amasawa Ichika<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ishigami Kyō (Class 1-A)<\/b> &quot;Can I help you?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.62<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ishigami Kyō (Class 1-A)<\/b> &quot;It&#x27;s fine, Horikita-senpai. But why me?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.62<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ishigami Kyō (Class 1-A)<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;m sorry, but I&#x27;m not interested in joining.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.65<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I have no interest in club activities nor in joining the student council.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.65<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Please look elsewhere.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.65<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Calm, polite to upperclassmen, and single-minded — refuses Horikita&#x27;s student-council invitation instantly and without hesitation; Horikita decides she cannot force him, and Ayanokōji notes such motivated students would have applied earlier.<span class=\"pg\">p.62–65<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> She invites him to the student council; he declines courteously with &quot;Horikita-senpai.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.62–65<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Amasawa Ichika<\/b> His Class A classmate, who recognizes him and describes him as the class&#x27;s strategist.<span class=\"pg\">p.61–62<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> He meets Ayanokōji&#x27;s gaze with a silent stare and shows no sign of agitation at the unexpected first meeting.<span class=\"pg\">p.62<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ayanokōji notes the Class D option is also an easy solution &quot;given that she&#x27;d been turned down by Ishigami.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.66<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ishigami-kyou-y2v9-p61-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"","w":"ishigami-kyou","q":"ishigami kyo named as  the ishigami i pictured  the class 1 a confusion named in conversation only   when horikita says she is meeting  ishigami kun  ayanokoji assumes it is the second year keisei he has in mind  there were no other first year students with the same surname  before realizing horikita means the first year  keisei himself is not on page","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ishigami-kyou-y2v9-p61-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ishigami-kyou.html#sc-ishigami-kyou-y2v9-p61-1\">Named as &quot;the Ishigami I pictured&quot;: the Class 1-A confusion<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.61–66<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ishigami-kyou.html\">Ishigami Kyō<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in conversation only — when Horikita says she is meeting &quot;Ishigami-kun,&quot; Ayanokōji assumes it is the second-year Keisei he has in mind (&quot;There were no other first-year students with the same surname&quot;), before realizing Horikita means the first-year; Keisei himself is not on-page.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-nanase-tsubasa-y2v9-p67-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune kushida-kikyou nanase-tsubasa","q":"nanase tsubasa nanase  accepted onto the student council horikita invites her to join the student council  she happily agrees  exchanges contact details  and says she is glad to gain more contacts   umm  what should i do from tomorrow onwards   i m glad to have more contacts as well   yes  i m looking forward to hearing from you  she arrives at the council room  greets horikita politely and chats easily with kushida  nagumo formally approves her as a new member from class 1 d   good evening  horikita senpai  cheerful  socially eager and polite   delighted at the chance to join and quick to bond with her fellow new member  recruited by her  calls her senpai  hits it off with her immediately in the council room","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-nanase-tsubasa-y2v9-p67-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/nanase-tsubasa.html#sc-nanase-tsubasa-y2v9-p67-1\">Nanase: accepted onto the student council<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.67–73<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/nanase-tsubasa.html\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Horikita invites her to join the student council; she happily agrees, exchanges contact details, and says she is glad to gain more contacts. She arrives at the council room, greets Horikita politely and chats easily with Kushida; Nagumo formally approves her as a new member from Class 1-D.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kushida-kikyou.html\">Kushida Kikyō<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/b> &quot;Umm, what should I do from tomorrow onwards?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.67<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;m glad to have more contacts as well!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.67<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/b> &quot;Yes, I&#x27;m looking forward to hearing from you!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.67<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Good evening, Horikita-senpai.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Cheerful, socially eager and polite — delighted at the chance to join and quick to bond with her fellow new member.<span class=\"pg\">p.67–73<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Recruited by her; calls her senpai.<span class=\"pg\">p.67–73<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> Hits it off with her immediately in the council room.<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shinohara-satsuki-y2v9-p69-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ike-kanji sudou-ken shinohara-satsuki","q":"shinohara satsuki shinohara at the cafe study group  admiring sudo  needling ike at the keyaki cafe study group  she notices sudo arrive in reading glasses and admires how different he looks   what  sudou kun wears glasses   you look pretty different just by wearing glasses  and you ve started to study more  haven t you  she pokes her boyfriend ike beside her and  with barbed praise  compares his effort to sudo s  when he tries to argue  her stinging words make him fall silent   i know that  i know  but there s still a big gap between sudou kun and the two of us  now an active participant in the study groups  suddenly motivated  riding a wave  but still sharp tongued toward ike  she openly admires sudo s growth while needling her boyfriend to keep up  her boyfriend  she pokes him and undercuts his boasting  admires his transformation and asks him for tips on sustaining study","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shinohara-satsuki-y2v9-p69-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/shinohara-satsuki.html#sc-shinohara-satsuki-y2v9-p69-1\">Shinohara at the café study group: admiring Sudō, needling Ike<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.69–70<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/shinohara-satsuki.html\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At the Keyaki café study group, she notices Sudō arrive in reading glasses and admires how different he looks. She pokes her boyfriend Ike beside her and, with barbed praise, compares his effort to Sudō&#x27;s; when he tries to argue, her stinging words make him fall silent.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/b> &quot;What? Sudou-kun wears glasses?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.69<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/b> &quot;You look pretty different just by wearing glasses. And you&#x27;ve started to study more, haven&#x27;t you?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.69<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/b> &quot;I know that. I know, but there&#x27;s still a big gap between Sudou-kun and the two of us.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.70<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Now an active participant in the study groups (&quot;suddenly motivated,&quot; riding a wave), but still sharp-tongued toward Ike; she openly admires Sudō&#x27;s growth while needling her boyfriend to keep up.<span class=\"pg\">p.69–70<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> Her boyfriend; she pokes him and undercuts his boasting.<span class=\"pg\">p.69–70<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> Admires his transformation and asks him for tips on sustaining study.<span class=\"pg\">p.69–70<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shinohara-satsuki-y2v9-p141-1\">→ After: Shinohara: motivated in the lunch study grind<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-sudou-ken-y2v9-p69-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune shinohara-satsuki sudou-ken","q":"sudo ken sudo at the cafe study group  glasses  maturity and study tips arrives late and out of breath to the keyaki cafe study group after basketball practice  takes out a rectangular case and puts on reading glasses  surprising classmates who have never seen him study   it s no big deal  i do it all the time   what are you staring at me for  shinohara and the others ask how he keeps at it  he reflects that he once saw study as a distraction from basketball  but worried that if he fails to go pro he d have few options  so he now calls study an investment in his future   studying is an investment in your future  that s what i think   that s enough small talk  right  let s get on with our studies  matured considerably   the former bottom of the class athlete now studies in glasses  balances basketball with homework without complaint  and articulates a realistic reason to keep studying  his short  unpolished speech is credited with motivating peers who once laughed at him  she was the original reason he started studying  the group notes his rise from the class s lowest academic rank  she admires how different he looks in glasses and asks for his tips on sustained study","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-sudou-ken-y2v9-p69-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/sudou-ken.html#sc-sudou-ken-y2v9-p69-1\">Sudō at the café study group: glasses, maturity and study tips<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.69–71<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Arrives late and out of breath to the Keyaki café study group after basketball practice; takes out a rectangular case and puts on reading glasses, surprising classmates who have never seen him study. Shinohara and the others ask how he keeps at it; he reflects that he once saw study as a distraction from basketball, but worried that if he fails to go pro he&#x27;d have few options, so he now calls study an investment in his future.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/shinohara-satsuki.html\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> &quot;It&#x27;s no big deal. I do it all the time.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.69<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> &quot;What are you staring at me for?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.69<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> &quot;Studying is an investment in your future. That&#x27;s what I think.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.71<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;That&#x27;s enough small talk, right? Let&#x27;s get on with our studies.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.71<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Matured considerably — the former bottom-of-the-class athlete now studies in glasses, balances basketball with homework without complaint, and articulates a realistic reason to keep studying; his short, unpolished speech is credited with motivating peers who once laughed at him.<span class=\"pg\">p.69–71<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> She was the original reason he started studying; the group notes his rise from the class&#x27;s lowest academic rank.<span class=\"pg\">p.70<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/b> She admires how different he looks in glasses and asks for his tips on sustained study.<span class=\"pg\">p.69–70<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kushida-kikyou-y2v9-p73-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune nanase-tsubasa kushida-kikyou","q":"kushida kikyo kushida  sworn in  then secretary on the shoplifting case sworn in alongside nanase as a new student council member  she tells horikita she had been nervous about who else would join and was relieved it was nanase   i was relieved earlier when i heard that nanase san was also joining the student council  i was so nervous about who else would be joining us  in the hearing into kiryuin s shoplifting complaint she brings her own notebook  proud to be keeping the record as the new secretary  and supplies the key reasoning  framing nagumo only makes sense if the culprit fears someone else more   i ve got some third party testimony in this shoplifting case   trying to pin the blame on nagumo senpai in the third year is only a  eager to prove herself in her first student council job  and perceptive   she reads the contradiction in the testimonies and correctly suggests the accusers fear the real culprit  brings evidence to the new president s first hearing  relieved to be joining the council with her","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kushida-kikyou-y2v9-p73-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kushida-kikyou.html#sc-kushida-kikyou-y2v9-p73-1\">Kushida: sworn in, then secretary on the shoplifting case<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.73, 180–187<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kushida-kikyou.html\">Kushida Kikyō<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Sworn in alongside Nanase as a new student-council member; she tells Horikita she had been nervous about who else would join and was relieved it was Nanase. In the hearing into Kiryūin&#x27;s shoplifting complaint she brings her own notebook, proud to be keeping the record as the new secretary, and supplies the key reasoning: framing Nagumo only makes sense if the culprit fears someone else more.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nanase-tsubasa.html\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> &quot;I was relieved earlier when I heard that Nanase-san was also joining the student council. I was so nervous about who else would be joining us.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;ve got some third-party testimony in this shoplifting case.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.181<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> &quot;Trying to pin the blame on Nagumo-senpai in the third year is only a...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.185<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Eager to prove herself in her first student-council job, and perceptive — she reads the contradiction in the testimonies and correctly suggests the accusers fear the real culprit.<span class=\"pg\">p.180–187<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Brings evidence to the new president&#x27;s first hearing.<span class=\"pg\">p.181–187<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/b> Relieved to be joining the council with her.<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kushida-kikyou-y2v9-p8-1\">← Before: Kushida: a morning glare, then recruited to the student council<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-nagumo-miyabi-y2v9-p74-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune ayanokouji-kiyotaka nagumo-miyabi","q":"nagumo miyabi nagumo s farewell  regrets at the handover at the formal handover he pats the president s chair reluctantly  says the tenure was both long and short  and admits his regret   he wanted talented students to graduate in class a across class lines but could not overturn the school s decisions  he tells ayanokoji their battle is not over   well  i guess i m relieved of my duties as student council president now   it was both a long and short time  it s an indescribable feeling  reflective and slightly wistful at leaving   he acknowledges the limits of the council s power  takes pride in the oaa transfer ticket system he introduced  and hints at unfinished business with ayanokoji  hands her the presidency  she notes his influence on the school s rules  reminds him their battle is not over","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-nagumo-miyabi-y2v9-p74-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html#sc-nagumo-miyabi-y2v9-p74-1\">Nagumo&#x27;s farewell: regrets at the handover<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.74–75<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At the formal handover he pats the president&#x27;s chair reluctantly, says the tenure was both long and short, and admits his regret — he wanted talented students to graduate in Class A across class lines but could not overturn the school&#x27;s decisions; he tells Ayanokōji their battle is not over.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> &quot;Well, I guess I&#x27;m relieved of my duties as student council president now.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.74<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> &quot;It was both a long and short time. It&#x27;s an indescribable feeling.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.74<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Reflective and slightly wistful at leaving — he acknowledges the limits of the council&#x27;s power, takes pride in the OAA/transfer-ticket system he introduced, and hints at unfinished business with Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.74–75<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Hands her the presidency; she notes his influence on the school&#x27;s rules.<span class=\"pg\">p.74<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Reminds him their battle is not over.<span class=\"pg\">p.75<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-nagumo-miyabi-y2v9-p18-1\">← Before: Nagumo: his final act as president; exposed by Kiryūin<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiriyama-ikuto-y2v9-p75-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune kiryuin-fuuka nagumo-miyabi kiriyama-ikuto","q":"kiriyama ikuto kiriyama  inauguration  then exposed as the shoplifting mastermind at the handover he reminds ayanokoji their battle is not over   see you  ayanokouji  our battle isn t over yet  he arranges the student council hearing at nagumo s request and acts as the  familiar third party  but horikita s reasoning   that yamanaka and tachibana feared someone more than nagumo   lands on him   i understand that kiryuuin s upset that she was almost made to look like a shoplifter   there s no guarantee that the information ayanokouji has given you is true  as witnesses are about to be called  he confesses  he used nagumo s message assigning him a point earning job as cover and had yamanaka frame kiryuin   got it  let s stop this now   it means that there s no need to call witnesses  i admit that it was me who   i m sorry kiryuuin  but it had to be you  in order to achieve my goal  calculating and proud   a guaranteed class a ticket meant he would never move against nagumo  so he chose kiryuin as the target  cornered by solid logic  he owns the plot rather than drag witnesses into it  her first case as president sees through him  he confesses  he admits he framed her deliberately  cites his class a ticket as proof he had no motive  used his message as cover","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiriyama-ikuto-y2v9-p75-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kiriyama-ikuto.html#sc-kiriyama-ikuto-y2v9-p75-1\">Kiriyama: inauguration, then exposed as the shoplifting mastermind<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.75, 183–190<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kiriyama-ikuto.html\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At the handover he reminds Ayanokōji their battle is not over. He arranges the student-council hearing at Nagumo&#x27;s request and acts as the &quot;familiar third party,&quot; but Horikita&#x27;s reasoning — that Yamanaka and Tachibana feared someone more than Nagumo — lands on him. As witnesses are about to be called, he confesses: he used Nagumo&#x27;s message assigning him a point-earning job as cover and had Yamanaka frame Kiryūin.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kiryuin-fuuka.html\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/b> &quot;See you, Ayanokouji. Our battle isn&#x27;t over yet.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.75<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/b> &quot;I understand that Kiryuuin&#x27;s upset that she was almost made to look like a shoplifter.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.185<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/b> &quot;There&#x27;s no guarantee that the information Ayanokouji has given you is true.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.188<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Got it. Let&#x27;s stop this now.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.189<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;It means that there&#x27;s no need to call witnesses. I admit that it was me who...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.189<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;m sorry Kiryuuin, but it had to be you, in order to achieve my goal.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.189<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Calculating and proud — a guaranteed Class A ticket meant he would never move against Nagumo, so he chose Kiryūin as the target; cornered by solid logic, he owns the plot rather than drag witnesses into it.<span class=\"pg\">p.183–190<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Her first case as president sees through him; he confesses.<span class=\"pg\">p.188–190<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/b> He admits he framed her deliberately.<span class=\"pg\">p.189<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Cites his Class A ticket as proof he had no motive; used his message as cover.<span class=\"pg\">p.188–190<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kiriyama-ikuto-y2v9-p26-1\">← Before: Kiriyama: the 20-million-point bet and his last stand<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9-p76-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka nagumo-miyabi kiryuin-fuuka","q":"kiryuin fuuka kiryuin recruits ayanokoji to investigate she stops ayanokoji outside the council room and asks him to dig into the shoplifting case   nagumo and kiriyama have blocked her from re questioning yamanaka  and she needs someone with a neutral perspective and fighting ability   can i have a moment of your time  ayanokouji   no  my pride won t allow me to meditate on his attempt to incriminate me   cooperate with me  i don t have anyone i can call a friend  i can t act like a detective  prideful but strategic   she refuses to let the frame up rest  flatters ayanokoji s abilities  and invokes his debt from the island exam to force his cooperation  presses him into investigating by appealing to his neutrality and fighting sense  blocked by him from re questioning yamanaka","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9-p76-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kiryuin-fuuka.html#sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9-p76-1\">Kiryūin recruits Ayanokōji to investigate<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.76–78<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kiryuin-fuuka.html\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She stops Ayanokōji outside the council room and asks him to dig into the shoplifting case — Nagumo and Kiriyama have blocked her from re-questioning Yamanaka, and she needs someone with a neutral perspective and fighting ability.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/b> &quot;Can I have a moment of your time, Ayanokouji?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.76<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/b> &quot;No. My pride won&#x27;t allow me to meditate on his attempt to incriminate me.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.77<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/b> &quot;Cooperate with me. I don&#x27;t have anyone I can call a friend. I can&#x27;t act like a detective.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.78<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Prideful but strategic — she refuses to let the frame-up rest, flatters Ayanokōji&#x27;s abilities, and invokes his debt from the island exam to force his cooperation.<span class=\"pg\">p.76–78<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Presses him into investigating by appealing to his neutrality and fighting sense.<span class=\"pg\">p.76–78<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Blocked by him from re-questioning Yamanaka.<span class=\"pg\">p.76<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9-p29-1\">← Before: Kiryūin interrupts the election meeting<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9-p180-1\">→ After: Kiryūin: the shoplifting complaint and her demand for an apology<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shibata-sou-y2v9-p90-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"","w":"shibata-sou","q":"shibata so shibata mentioned in passing named in watanabe s conversation    shibata would cry if he found out  named in the ryuuen confrontation   shibata stops ishizaki and albert from barging in  passing mentions  not a distinct scene presence","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shibata-sou-y2v9-p90-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/shibata-sou.html#sc-shibata-sou-y2v9-p90-1\">Shibata mentioned in passing<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.90, 144<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/shibata-sou.html\">Shibata Sō<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in Watanabe&#x27;s conversation — &quot;Shibata would cry if he found out.&quot; Named in the Ryuuen confrontation — Shibata stops Ishizaki and Albert from barging in.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mentions; not a distinct scene presence.<span class=\"pg\">p.90, 144<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v9-p91-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami hamaguchi-tetsuya ayanokouji-kiyotaka kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji kanzaki  a secret plan to save ichinose s class at a karaoke gathering he and watanabe press ayanokoji for why ichinose quit the council  worrying she has lost her will to reach class a  he reveals the real reason for the meeting  to build a team to help ichinose s class  bringing in hamaguchi and swearing everyone to secrecy   for the time being  hamaguchi  please sit here   i ve already talked to hamaguchi about helping us on this matter   it s a gamble  it s important to proceed slowly under the radar  but with  he argues the class must act now and  after debate with himeno and watanabe  asks ayanokoji to check on ichinose under the guise of a date  principled and quietly organizing   he has moved from private resistance to actively gathering allies to rescue the class  careful to work under the radar and willing to gamble on trusted outsiders  his classmate whose withdrawal he is trying to reverse  he worries she may give up on class a  recruited as the third member of the team  trusted with the secret and asked to sound out ichinose","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v9-p91-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html#sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v9-p91-1\">Kanzaki: a secret plan to save Ichinose&#x27;s class<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.91–101<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At a karaoke gathering he and Watanabe press Ayanokōji for why Ichinose quit the council, worrying she has lost her will to reach Class A. He reveals the real reason for the meeting: to build a team to help Ichinose&#x27;s class, bringing in Hamaguchi and swearing everyone to secrecy. He argues the class must act now and, after debate with Himeno and Watanabe, asks Ayanokōji to check on Ichinose under the guise of a date.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hamaguchi-tetsuya.html\">Hamaguchi Tetsuya<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> &quot;For the time being... Hamaguchi, please sit here.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.94<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;ve already talked to Hamaguchi about helping us on this matter.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.94<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> &quot;It&#x27;s a gamble. It&#x27;s important to proceed slowly under the radar, but with...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.95<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Principled and quietly organizing — he has moved from private resistance to actively gathering allies to rescue the class, careful to work under the radar and willing to gamble on trusted outsiders.<span class=\"pg\">p.91–101<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> His classmate whose withdrawal he is trying to reverse; he worries she may give up on Class A.<span class=\"pg\">p.91–101<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hamaguchi Tetsuya<\/b> Recruited as the third member of the team.<span class=\"pg\">p.93–95<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Trusted with the secret and asked to sound out Ichinose.<span class=\"pg\">p.95–100<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-watanabe-norihito-y2v9-p91-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji ishizaki-daichi watanabe-norihito","q":"watanabe norihito watanabe  pressing for the truth and pushing the class to act at the karaoke meeting he joins kanzaki in questioning ayanokoji about why ichinose quit the council  reading her continued drive but suspecting she has lost the will to fight for class a   why are you so calm  ayanokouji  i mean  you re pretty lucky to be liked  he is let into kanzaki s secret plan  when ryuen s men ishizaki and komiya barge in  he challenges their motive  and later argues the class must speak out rather than stand still   oooooh  i ll get out of your way   why are you here  ishizaki and komiya  wry and outspoken   he talks casually with ayanokoji  distrusts ryuen s interference  and is one of the few urging that the class stop hesitating and act  co conspirator in the plan to help ichinose s class  they discuss how to approach her  challenges him and komiya for crashing their gathering","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-watanabe-norihito-y2v9-p91-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/watanabe-norihito.html#sc-watanabe-norihito-y2v9-p91-1\">Watanabe: pressing for the truth and pushing the class to act<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.91–100<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/watanabe-norihito.html\">Watanabe Norihito<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At the karaoke meeting he joins Kanzaki in questioning Ayanokōji about why Ichinose quit the council, reading her continued drive but suspecting she has lost the will to fight for Class A. He is let into Kanzaki&#x27;s secret plan; when Ryūen&#x27;s men Ishizaki and Komiya barge in, he challenges their motive, and later argues the class must speak out rather than stand still.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Watanabe Norihito<\/b> &quot;Why are you so calm, Ayanokouji? I mean, you&#x27;re pretty lucky to be liked...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.91<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Watanabe Norihito<\/b> &quot;Oooooh! I&#x27;ll get out of your way~!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.95<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Watanabe Norihito<\/b> &quot;Why are you here, Ishizaki and Komiya?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.97<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Wry and outspoken — he talks casually with Ayanokōji, distrusts Ryūen&#x27;s interference, and is one of the few urging that the class stop hesitating and act.<span class=\"pg\">p.91–100<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> Co-conspirator in the plan to help Ichinose&#x27;s class; they discuss how to approach her.<span class=\"pg\">p.91–99<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> Challenges him and Komiya for crashing their gathering.<span class=\"pg\">p.97<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-watanabe-norihito-y2v9-p102-1\">→ After: Watanabe&#x27;s confession: he likes Amikura<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hamaguchi-tetsuya-y2v9-p93-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji ayanokouji-kiyotaka hamaguchi-tetsuya","q":"hamaguchi tetsuya hamaguchi  recruited to the secret team to help ichinose at the karaoke meeting kanzaki introduces him to ayanokoji as the newest member of the group working to save ichinose s class  he greets ayanokoji like an old acquaintance and is seated beside him   hey  ayanokouji kun  i wonder if we ve met face to face like this since the  the translation leaves it untagged who asks whether hamaguchi was the expected late arrival  kanzaki seats him beside ayanokoji  a trusted third year ally quietly brought into kanzaki s plan  he is indebted to ayanokoji from a past favor and willing to work under the radar for the class  recruited by him as the third member of the team  greets him warmly  recalling a past debt","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hamaguchi-tetsuya-y2v9-p93-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/hamaguchi-tetsuya.html#sc-hamaguchi-tetsuya-y2v9-p93-1\">Hamaguchi: recruited to the secret team to help Ichinose<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.93–95<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/hamaguchi-tetsuya.html\">Hamaguchi Tetsuya<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At the karaoke meeting Kanzaki introduces him to Ayanokōji as the newest member of the group working to save Ichinose&#x27;s class; he greets Ayanokōji like an old acquaintance and is seated beside him.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hamaguchi Tetsuya<\/b> &quot;Hey, Ayanokouji-kun. I wonder if we&#x27;ve met face to face like this since the...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.93<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> The translation leaves it untagged who asks whether Hamaguchi was the expected late arrival; Kanzaki seats him beside Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.94<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> A trusted third-year ally quietly brought into Kanzaki&#x27;s plan; he is indebted to Ayanokōji from a past favor and willing to work under the radar for the class.<span class=\"pg\">p.93–95<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> Recruited by him as the third member of the team.<span class=\"pg\">p.93–95<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Greets him warmly, recalling a past debt.<span class=\"pg\">p.93<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-himeno-yuki-y2v9-p93-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji ichinose-honami himeno-yuki","q":"himeno yuki himeno  speaking up for ichinose s class at the secret karaoke meeting she listens as kanzaki recruits hamaguchi and admits the plan is a gamble   i don t mind being trusted  but  kanzaki calls her by name and she takes the opening to finally voice the view she had long kept inside   that comfortable harmony cannot reach class a   revealing kanzaki s seriousness moved her to speak   i don t like the stance where  everyone holds hands and gets along with   but i always thought that i could never make it to class a with only  still finding her voice  but now willing to say openly what she once kept silent   she rejects comfortable harmony in favor of real change and credits kanzaki s resolve for her candor  his seriousness about changing the class is what made her start speaking up  wants to be there for her and help rebuild the class","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-himeno-yuki-y2v9-p93-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/himeno-yuki.html#sc-himeno-yuki-y2v9-p93-1\">Himeno: speaking up for Ichinose&#x27;s class<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.93–100<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/himeno-yuki.html\">Himeno Yuki<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At the secret karaoke meeting she listens as Kanzaki recruits Hamaguchi and admits the plan is a gamble. Kanzaki calls her by name and she takes the opening to finally voice the view she had long kept inside — that comfortable harmony cannot reach Class A — revealing Kanzaki&#x27;s seriousness moved her to speak.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Himeno Yuki<\/b> &quot;I don&#x27;t mind being trusted, but...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.95<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Himeno Yuki<\/b> &quot;I don&#x27;t like the stance where &#x27;everyone holds hands and gets along with...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.100<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Himeno Yuki<\/b> &quot;But I always thought that I could never make it to Class A with only...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.100<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Still finding her voice, but now willing to say openly what she once kept silent — she rejects comfortable harmony in favor of real change and credits Kanzaki&#x27;s resolve for her candor.<span class=\"pg\">p.95–100<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> His seriousness about changing the class is what made her start speaking up.<span class=\"pg\">p.99–100<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Wants to be there for her and help rebuild the class.<span class=\"pg\">p.100<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-himeno-yuki-y2v9-p108-1\">→ After: Himeno&#x27;s night walk: doubt after the karaoke meeting<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-amikura-mako-y2v9-p95-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami ayanokouji-kiyotaka kanzaki-ryuuji amikura-mako","q":"amikura mako amikura  secret keeper  gym witness  and friend at the karaoke meeting she is one of the two let into kanzaki s secret plan  she voices reservations about keeping it from ichinose and is reassured it is a gamble   i don t mind being trusted  but  at the gym she runs into ichinose and ayanokoji  is surprised  and quietly reads the situation   noting ayanokoji and the gym do not fit together and later teasing ichinose   oh  mako chan  good morning   w what are you doing at the gym   this is your first time in a gym  right  take it easy  ayanokouji kun  loyal and observant   trusted with a dangerous secret  careful about how it is used  and perceptive enough to notice the chemistry between her best friend and ayanokoji  her best friend  honami chan  surprised to find her at the gym with ayanokoji  teases him for being out of place at the gym  let into his secret plan to help ichinose s class","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-amikura-mako-y2v9-p95-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/amikura-mako.html#sc-amikura-mako-y2v9-p95-1\">Amikura: secret-keeper, gym witness, and friend<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.95–97, 124–129<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/amikura-mako.html\">Amikura Mako<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At the karaoke meeting she is one of the two let into Kanzaki&#x27;s secret plan; she voices reservations about keeping it from Ichinose and is reassured it is a gamble. At the gym she runs into Ichinose and Ayanokōji, is surprised, and quietly reads the situation — noting Ayanokōji and the gym do not fit together and later teasing Ichinose.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Amikura Mako<\/b> &quot;I don&#x27;t mind being trusted, but...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.95<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;Oh, Mako-chan, good morning!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.124<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Amikura Mako<\/b> &quot;W-what are you doing at the gym?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.125<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;This is your first time in a gym, right? Take it easy, Ayanokouji-kun.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.126<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Loyal and observant — trusted with a dangerous secret, careful about how it is used, and perceptive enough to notice the chemistry between her best friend and Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.95–129<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Her best friend (&quot;Honami-chan&quot;); surprised to find her at the gym with Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.124–129<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Teases him for being out of place at the gym.<span class=\"pg\">p.125–126<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> Let into his secret plan to help Ichinose&#x27;s class.<span class=\"pg\">p.95–97<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ishizaki-daichi-y2v9-p96-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ryuuen-kakeru komiya-kyogo ishizaki-daichi","q":"ishizaki daichi ishizaki  karaoke intrusion and harassment duty he and komiya barge into the karaoke room where kanzaki s group is holding a secret meeting  he spins lame excuses about checking on fellow second years and leaves clicking his tongue when asked to go   why  well  there are a lot of reasons  you know  he joins ryuen in confronting ichinose s study group as part of the ordered harassment  a loyal ryuen lieutenant who carries out the class s harassment and doesn t hide his irritation when a bluff fails  acts on his orders to harass ichinose s class  his classmate and partner in the karaoke intrusion","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ishizaki-daichi-y2v9-p96-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ishizaki-daichi.html#sc-ishizaki-daichi-y2v9-p96-1\">Ishizaki: karaoke intrusion and harassment duty<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.96, 145<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He and Komiya barge into the karaoke room where Kanzaki&#x27;s group is holding a secret meeting; he spins lame excuses about checking on fellow second-years and leaves clicking his tongue when asked to go. He joins Ryūen in confronting Ichinose&#x27;s study group as part of the ordered harassment.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/komiya-kyogo.html\">Komiya Kyogo<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> &quot;Why, well, there are a lot of reasons. You know?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.96<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> A loyal Ryūen lieutenant who carries out the class&#x27;s harassment and doesn&#x27;t hide his irritation when a bluff fails.<span class=\"pg\">p.96, 145<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Acts on his orders to harass Ichinose&#x27;s class.<span class=\"pg\">p.96, 145<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Komiya Kyogo<\/b> His classmate and partner in the karaoke intrusion.<span class=\"pg\">p.96<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v9-p96-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ishizaki-daichi ryuuen-kakeru komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo komiya  karaoke intrusion with ishizaki he and ishizaki barge into kanzaki s karaoke meeting  claiming they only came to join the singing  kanzaki sees through the excuse and they leave clicking their tongues   oh  oh  we were both at karaoke and i saw you guys  i thought it would be more fun to have a bunch of people singing than just two guys singing in solitude  playfully evasive   helps keep up the pretense that the intrusion is harmless fun  his classmate and partner in the intrusion  the harassment is done on his orders","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v9-p96-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/komiya-kyogo.html#sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v9-p96-1\">Komiya: karaoke intrusion with Ishizaki<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.96<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/komiya-kyogo.html\">Komiya Kyogo<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He and Ishizaki barge into Kanzaki&#x27;s karaoke meeting, claiming they only came to join the singing; Kanzaki sees through the excuse and they leave clicking their tongues.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Komiya Kyogo<\/b> &quot;Oh, oh. We were both at karaoke and I saw you guys. I thought it would be more fun to have a bunch of people singing than just two guys singing in solitude.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.96<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Playfully evasive — helps keep up the pretense that the intrusion is harmless fun.<span class=\"pg\">p.96<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> His classmate and partner in the intrusion.<span class=\"pg\">p.96<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> The harassment is done on his orders.<span class=\"pg\">p.96<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-watanabe-norihito-y2v9-p102-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"amikura-mako ayanokouji-kiyotaka watanabe-norihito","q":"watanabe norihito watanabe s confession  he likes amikura he follows ayanokoji to the restroom and  haltingly  asks him to probe ichinose about whether amikura likes anyone   then admits  flustered  that he has a crush on her   you have a crush on amikura   hey  hey  hey  don t be so blunt here  he reveals he tried to ask amikura out that morning but couldn t hold a conversation alone  was nervous  and ended up tagging along to the mall with the group  he asks ayanokoji to find out casually whether she likes someone   i was aiming for something close to that  i woke up early and got ready  and then we met up in the lobby of the dorm  i was so nervous  awkward and honest about romance   normally clear spoken  he becomes incoherent around amikura  can t read his own feelings  but is positive and relieved to have no rivals  the girl he likes  he is grateful to her for looking after him on the school trip  trusts him enough to ask him to probe ichinose about amikura","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-watanabe-norihito-y2v9-p102-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/watanabe-norihito.html#sc-watanabe-norihito-y2v9-p102-1\">Watanabe&#x27;s confession: he likes Amikura<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.102–105<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/watanabe-norihito.html\">Watanabe Norihito<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He follows Ayanokōji to the restroom and, haltingly, asks him to probe Ichinose about whether Amikura likes anyone — then admits, flustered, that he has a crush on her. He reveals he tried to ask Amikura out that morning but couldn&#x27;t hold a conversation alone, was nervous, and ended up tagging along to the mall with the group; he asks Ayanokōji to find out casually whether she likes someone.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/amikura-mako.html\">Amikura Mako<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Watanabe Norihito<\/b> &quot;You have a crush on Amikura.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.103<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Watanabe Norihito<\/b> &quot;Hey, hey, hey! Don&#x27;t be so blunt here!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.103<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Watanabe Norihito<\/b> &quot;I was aiming for something close to that. I woke up early and got ready. And then we met up in the lobby of the dorm. I was so nervous.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.103<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Awkward and honest about romance — normally clear-spoken, he becomes incoherent around Amikura, can&#x27;t read his own feelings, but is positive and relieved to have no rivals.<span class=\"pg\">p.102–105<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Amikura Mako<\/b> The girl he likes; he is grateful to her for looking after him on the school trip.<span class=\"pg\">p.102–105<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Trusts him enough to ask him to probe Ichinose about Amikura.<span class=\"pg\">p.102–105<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-watanabe-norihito-y2v9-p91-1\">← Before: Watanabe: pressing for the truth and pushing the class to act<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ishikura-kayoko-y2v9-p106-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"","w":"ishikura-kayoko","q":"ishikura kayoko ishikura  in kei s girls  night message named only   kei s photo message shows her with sato  mori  ishikura and maezono gathered in the girls  room for the evening","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ishikura-kayoko-y2v9-p106-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ishikura-kayoko.html#sc-ishikura-kayoko-y2v9-p106-1\">Ishikura: in Kei&#x27;s girls&#x27; night message<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.106<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ishikura-kayoko.html\">Ishikura Kayoko<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named only — Kei&#x27;s photo-message shows her with Satō, Mori, Ishikura and Maezono gathered in the girls&#x27; room for the evening.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-himeno-yuki-y2v9-p108-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka kanzaki-ryuuji himeno-yuki","q":"himeno yuki himeno s night walk  doubt after the karaoke meeting ayanokoji finds her standing alone on the street at night  she had declined to keep hanging out with the group  preferring to be alone  and admits she went to the store and movie theater  in a daze  she confesses the karaoke meeting hit her hard   she realized she had baseless confidence that teaming with kanzaki made her special  and feels her attempts to change the class are going haywire  she asks if class a is still reachable if the class changes   do you think there s still a chance for us to reach class a if our class changes  introspective and still uneasy in groups   she is honest about her doubts and feels her efforts are starting to go wrong  but is reassured when ayanokoji says change is coming and agrees to help  she ends with a small  embarrassed victory pose  opens up to him about her doubts  reassured by his conditional  yes  and promise to help  she declined to keep hanging out with him and the others  rethinks their plan","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-himeno-yuki-y2v9-p108-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/himeno-yuki.html#sc-himeno-yuki-y2v9-p108-1\">Himeno&#x27;s night walk: doubt after the karaoke meeting<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.108–113<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/himeno-yuki.html\">Himeno Yuki<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Ayanokōji finds her standing alone on the street at night; she had declined to keep hanging out with the group, preferring to be alone, and admits she went to the store and movie theater &quot;in a daze.&quot; She confesses the karaoke meeting hit her hard — she realized she had baseless confidence that teaming with Kanzaki made her special, and feels her attempts to change the class are going haywire; she asks if Class A is still reachable if the class changes.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Himeno Yuki<\/b> &quot;Do you think there&#x27;s still a chance for us to reach Class A if our class changes?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.112<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Introspective and still uneasy in groups — she is honest about her doubts and feels her efforts are starting to go wrong, but is reassured when Ayanokōji says change is coming and agrees to help; she ends with a small, embarrassed victory pose.<span class=\"pg\">p.108–113<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Opens up to him about her doubts; reassured by his conditional &quot;yes&quot; and promise to help.<span class=\"pg\">p.111–113<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> She declined to keep hanging out with him and the others; rethinks their plan.<span class=\"pg\">p.111<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-himeno-yuki-y2v9-p93-1\">← Before: Himeno: speaking up for Ichinose&#x27;s class<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-minami-hakuo-y2v9-p114-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"","w":"minami-hakuo","q":"minami hakuo minami hakuo mentioned in passing named in the sakayanagi ultimatum scene   minami kun as one of the options  passing mention  not a scene presence  locator false positive on  minami","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-minami-hakuo-y2v9-p114-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/minami-hakuo.html#sc-minami-hakuo-y2v9-p114-1\">Minami-hakuo mentioned in passing<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.114<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/minami-hakuo.html\">Minami Hakuo<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in the Sakayanagi ultimatum scene — Minami-kun as one of the options.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mention; not a scene presence (locator false positive on &quot;Minami&quot;).<span class=\"pg\">p.114<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-minami-setsuya-y2v9-p114-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"","w":"minami-setsuya","q":"minami setsuya minami mentioned in the sakayanagi ultimatum scene named in the study session context   horikita quizzes ayanokoji about who is waiting for whom  naming minami as one option  passing mention only  not a scene presence","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-minami-setsuya-y2v9-p114-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/minami-setsuya.html#sc-minami-setsuya-y2v9-p114-1\">Minami mentioned in the Sakayanagi ultimatum scene<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.114<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/minami-setsuya.html\">Minami Setsuya<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in the study session context — Horikita quizzes Ayanokōji about who is waiting for whom, naming Minami as one option.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mention only; not a scene presence.<span class=\"pg\">p.114<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p118-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami amikura-mako ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka the gym date with ichinose  her changed feelings meets ichinose at the dorm lobby  she comes  prepared  unlike the trip  and goes to the gym with her   a  date  of sorts to learn why she resigned from the student council and about the  ideal man  she mentioned   i was surprised that you resigned from the student council  i thought there was a good chance you would win the student council election against horikita   i don t feel the need to support horikita just because we are classmates  if nagumo said he would support horikita  i still would have supported you  spends  2 hours training with ichinose  treadmill  weights  observes amikura teasing her about  a guy   ayanokoji  learns ichinose s class is studying hard  she reveals she quit the council to focus on the fight for class a  and that her feelings for him remain but she won t  take that final step that would go against her morals    he realizes ichinose has changed  eyes seemed to have more sparkle  and that her love had undeniably given her great strength  gym  date  she confides her reasons for quitting  resists confessing fully  she didn t take that final step    her love  still strong  but self restrained  she notices ichinose ayanokoji together  teases ichinose about  a guy     you have at least an idea that she has a special interest in you  don t you","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p118-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p118-1\">The gym date with Ichinose; her changed feelings<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.118–139<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Meets Ichinose at the dorm lobby (she comes &quot;prepared,&quot; unlike the trip) and goes to the gym with her — a &quot;date&quot; of sorts to learn why she resigned from the student council and about the &quot;ideal man&quot; she mentioned.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/amikura-mako.html\">Amikura Mako<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;I was surprised that you resigned from the student council. I thought there was a good chance you would win the student council election against Horikita.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.133<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;I don&#x27;t feel the need to support Horikita just because we are classmates. If Nagumo said he would support Horikita, I still would have supported you.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.133<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Spends ~2 hours training with Ichinose (treadmill, weights), observes Amikura teasing her about &quot;a guy&quot; (Ayanokōji), learns Ichinose&#x27;s class is studying hard; she reveals she quit the council to focus on the fight for Class A, and that her feelings for him remain but she won&#x27;t &quot;take that final step that would go against her morals&quot; — he realizes Ichinose has changed (&quot;eyes seemed to have more sparkle&quot;), and that her love had undeniably given her great strength.<span class=\"pg\">p.118–139<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Gym &quot;date&quot;; she confides her reasons for quitting, resists confessing fully (&quot;she didn&#x27;t take that final step&quot;) — her love &quot;still strong&quot; but self-restrained.<span class=\"pg\">p.118–139<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Amikura Mako<\/b> She notices Ichinose/Ayanokōji together, teases Ichinose about &quot;a guy&quot; — &quot;You have at least an idea that she has a special interest in you, don&#x27;t you?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.125–131<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p61-1\">← Before: Recruiting Nanase; Ishigami declines<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p153-1\">→ After: The shoplifting case: Kiriyama exposed as the mastermind<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9-p118-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka amikura-mako watanabe-norihito ichinose-honami","q":"ichinose honami ichinose  the  mirror your day off  gym date and cafe talk she meets ayanokoji before opening time at keyaki mall  accepts his request to shadow how she spends her day off  and leads him to the gym she joined in september   noting he has never been to one   how do i spend my days off   ayanokouji kun  you haven t been to the gym before  have you  she shows him the machines  is flustered when amikura finds them together and realizes her outfit is embarrassing  and works out happily  she is more tired than amikura and goes to rehydrate  while she is away amikura confesses she has had a crush on someone for five years and that watanabe is  normal  but ichinose could aim higher  after changing  ichinose suggests a bench rather than a cafe to avoid being seen with him   yeah  you know  it kind of stands out  in a small second floor cafe she rightly guesses the meeting was about her council resignation  they discuss how she gets along with everyone  and she agrees to shadow her life to learn social skills she lacks   does the reason why you invited me here today have anything to do with my resignation from the student council  cheerful  physically active  a self described  bit of an athlete  and naive about romance   she enjoys showing ayanokoji her routine  is easily embarrassed  and honestly admits her social confidence is a learned act  spends her day off with him at the gym and cafe  feels  bursting with happiness  her best friend  mako chan  who joins the workout and confides her five year crush  named by ayanokoji as a potential match  amikura says she could aim higher","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9-p118-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html#sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9-p118-1\">Ichinose: the &quot;mirror your day off&quot; gym date and café talk<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.118–140<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She meets Ayanokōji before opening time at Keyaki Mall, accepts his request to shadow how she spends her day off, and leads him to the gym she joined in September — noting he has never been to one. She shows him the machines, is flustered when Amikura finds them together and realizes her outfit is embarrassing, and works out happily; she is more tired than Amikura and goes to rehydrate. While she is away Amikura confesses she has had a crush on someone for five years and that Watanabe is &quot;normal&quot; but Ichinose could aim higher; after changing, Ichinose suggests a bench rather than a café to avoid being seen with him. In a small second-floor café she rightly guesses the meeting was about her council resignation; they discuss how she gets along with everyone, and she agrees to shadow her life to learn social skills she lacks.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/amikura-mako.html\">Amikura Mako<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/watanabe-norihito.html\">Watanabe Norihito<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;How do I spend my days off?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.121<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;Ayanokouji-kun, you haven&#x27;t been to the gym before, have you?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.123<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;Yeah. You know, it kind of stands out.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.132<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Does the reason why you invited me here today have anything to do with my resignation from the student council?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.133<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Cheerful, physically active (a self-described &quot;bit of an athlete&quot;), and naive about romance — she enjoys showing Ayanokōji her routine, is easily embarrassed, and honestly admits her social confidence is a learned act.<span class=\"pg\">p.118–140<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Spends her day off with him at the gym and café; feels &quot;bursting with happiness.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.118–140<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Amikura Mako<\/b> Her best friend (&quot;Mako-chan&quot;), who joins the workout and confides her five-year crush.<span class=\"pg\">p.124–131<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Watanabe Norihito<\/b> Named by Ayanokōji as a potential match; Amikura says she could aim higher.<span class=\"pg\">p.130<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9-p33-1\">← Before: Ichinose withdraws; resigns from the student council<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9-p144-1\">→ After: Ichinose withstands Ryūen&#x27;s provocation<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v9-p124-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"","w":"mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari mashima mentioned in passing named in the gym scene    i often see mashima sensei here as well  passing mention  not a scene presence","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v9-p124-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/mashima-tomonari.html#sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v9-p124-1\">Mashima mentioned in passing<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.124<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/mashima-tomonari.html\">Mashima Tomonari<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in the gym scene — &quot;I often see Mashima-sensei here as well.&quot;<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mention; not a scene presence.<span class=\"pg\">p.124<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ike-kanji-y2v9-p141-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"shinohara-satsuki hirata-yousuke ike-kanji","q":"ike kanji ike  the lunch study grind with shinohara at lunch he studies side by side with shinohara  says he is  suddenly motivated  and riding a wave  and tries to hug her when she finishes   only to get a textbook dropped on his head   it s been tough  i feel like i m paying for all the time i ve been slacking off   you re so reliable  that s my girlfriend  newly motivated and playful   he studies hard for the exam and fawns on shinohara  but hirata warns him not to push himself to collapse  his girlfriend  studies beside her and gets a textbook on the head for his trouble  compliments his effort and cautions him against overwork","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ike-kanji-y2v9-p141-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html#sc-ike-kanji-y2v9-p141-1\">Ike: the lunch study grind with Shinohara<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.141–142<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At lunch he studies side by side with Shinohara, says he is &quot;suddenly motivated&quot; and riding a wave, and tries to hug her when she finishes — only to get a textbook dropped on his head.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/shinohara-satsuki.html\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> &quot;It&#x27;s been tough, I feel like I&#x27;m paying for all the time I&#x27;ve been slacking off…&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.141<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> &quot;You&#x27;re so reliable. That&#x27;s my girlfriend!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.142<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Newly motivated and playful — he studies hard for the exam and fawns on Shinohara, but Hirata warns him not to push himself to collapse.<span class=\"pg\">p.141–142<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/b> His girlfriend; studies beside her and gets a textbook on the head for his trouble.<span class=\"pg\">p.141–142<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> Compliments his effort and cautions him against overwork.<span class=\"pg\">p.142<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ike-kanji-y2v9-p11-1\">← Before: Ike: the exam brief and the café study group<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shinohara-satsuki-y2v9-p141-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ike-kanji shinohara-satsuki","q":"shinohara satsuki shinohara  motivated in the lunch study grind at lunch she studies beside ike  says she is suddenly motivated and riding a wave  has never felt this way before  and drops her textbook on ike s head when he tries to hug her   i m suddenly motivated now  and i m riding the wave  i m in a good mood  newly enthusiastic about studying   a big change from her old slacking   and briskly dismissive of ike s antics  her boyfriend  study partner whom she silences with a textbook","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shinohara-satsuki-y2v9-p141-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/shinohara-satsuki.html#sc-shinohara-satsuki-y2v9-p141-1\">Shinohara: motivated in the lunch study grind<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.141–142<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/shinohara-satsuki.html\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At lunch she studies beside Ike, says she is suddenly motivated and riding a wave, has never felt this way before, and drops her textbook on Ike&#x27;s head when he tries to hug her.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;m suddenly motivated now, and I&#x27;m riding the wave. I&#x27;m in a good mood.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.141<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Newly enthusiastic about studying — a big change from her old slacking — and briskly dismissive of Ike&#x27;s antics.<span class=\"pg\">p.141–142<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> Her boyfriend; study partner whom she silences with a textbook.<span class=\"pg\">p.141–142<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shinohara-satsuki-y2v9-p69-1\">← Before: Shinohara at the café study group: admiring Sudō, needling Ike<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-sonoda-chiyo-y2v9-p141-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"sonoda-chiyo","q":"sonoda chiyo sonoda  drowsy during the lunch study grind at lunch during the daily exam prep grind  she is one of the sleep deprived students  she holds her head  shakes off sleepiness and says  i want to sleep  while mii chan gives her a gentle pep talk   i want to sleep  exhausted by the relentless studying but being pushed to keep going","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-sonoda-chiyo-y2v9-p141-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/sonoda-chiyo.html#sc-sonoda-chiyo-y2v9-p141-1\">Sonoda: drowsy during the lunch study grind<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.141<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/sonoda-chiyo.html\">Sonoda Chiyo<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At lunch during the daily exam-prep grind, she is one of the sleep-deprived students; she holds her head, shakes off sleepiness and says &quot;I want to sleep,&quot; while Mii-chan gives her a gentle pep talk.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sonoda Chiyo<\/b> &quot;I want to sleep…&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.141<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Exhausted by the relentless studying but being pushed to keep going.<span class=\"pg\">p.141<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-sonoda-masashi-y2v9-p141-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"","w":"sonoda-masashi","q":"sonoda masashi sonoda mentioned in the study grind named as one of the sleep deprived students in the lunch study grind  mii chan gives him a pep talk  passing mention  sonoda chiyo  the female sonoda  has the scene entry","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-sonoda-masashi-y2v9-p141-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/sonoda-masashi.html#sc-sonoda-masashi-y2v9-p141-1\">Sonoda mentioned in the study grind<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.141<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/sonoda-masashi.html\">Sonoda Masashi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named as one of the sleep-deprived students in the lunch study grind; Mii-chan gives him a pep talk.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mention; Sonoda Chiyo (the female Sonoda) has the scene entry.<span class=\"pg\">p.141<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9-p144-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ryuuen-kakeru kanzaki-ryuuji ichinose-honami","q":"ichinose honami ichinose withstands ryuen s provocation  it wouldn t look good if the student council president was a shoplifter   that blatant provocation  ryuen arrives to provoke her about quitting the student council  infiltrated it to earn good points  calling her a  shoplifter    but she  having  developed a resistance to such discussions  is no longer shaken  she calmly endures it  and kanzaki steps in to defend her   a sign of her new strength  he tries to break her before the special exam by taunting her about the student council shoplifting    if you lose to me in the next special exam  you re going to fall off a cliff  he interrupts to defend her    cut it out  ryuuen","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9-p144-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html#sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9-p144-1\">Ichinose withstands Ryūen&#x27;s provocation<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.144–147<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;It wouldn&#x27;t look good if the student council president was a shoplifter.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.145<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;That blatant provocation?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.147<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Ryūen arrives to provoke her about quitting the student council (infiltrated it to earn good points), calling her a &quot;shoplifter&quot; — but she, having &quot;developed a resistance to such discussions,&quot; is no longer shaken; she calmly endures it, and Kanzaki steps in to defend her — a sign of her new strength.<span class=\"pg\">p.144–147<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> He tries to break her before the special exam by taunting her about the student council/shoplifting — &quot;If you lose to me in the next special exam, you&#x27;re going to fall off a cliff.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.145–147<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> He interrupts to defend her — &quot;Cut it out, Ryuuen.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.146<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9-p118-1\">← Before: Ichinose: the &quot;mirror your day off&quot; gym date and café talk<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9-p213-1\">→ After: Ichinose: &quot;not yet,&quot; and the rain talk with Ryūen<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y2v9-p144-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami ishizaki-daichi ryuuen-kakeru","q":"ryuen kakeru ryuen  provoking ichinose s class over her council exit he and ishizaki barge into the study group to needle ichinose about quitting the student council  mocking the  foolish leader  and suggesting her past sins are being questioned   well  well  well  finally  you ve come out  the foolish leader who quit the   kukuku  or maybe your past sins are now being called into question  it   you can say whatever you want to me  but i don t want you to interfere with the hardworking students  still the aggressive provocateur   he tries to sabotage the rival class s study time and get a rise out of ichinose  but she refuses to be baited and warns him off  mocks her withdrawal  she warns him not to interfere with her studies  his lieutenant  who joins the harassment","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y2v9-p144-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html#sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y2v9-p144-1\">Ryūen: provoking Ichinose&#x27;s class over her council exit<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.144–147<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He and Ishizaki barge into the study group to needle Ichinose about quitting the student council, mocking the &quot;foolish leader&quot; and suggesting her past sins are being questioned.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> &quot;Well, well, well. Finally, you&#x27;ve come out. The foolish leader who quit the...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.144<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> &quot;Kukuku. Or maybe your past sins are now being called into question? It&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.145<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;You can say whatever you want to me, but I don&#x27;t want you to interfere with the hardworking students.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.146<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Still the aggressive provocateur — he tries to sabotage the rival class&#x27;s study time and get a rise out of Ichinose, but she refuses to be baited and warns him off.<span class=\"pg\">p.144–147<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Mocks her withdrawal; she warns him not to interfere with her studies.<span class=\"pg\">p.144–147<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> His lieutenant, who joins the harassment.<span class=\"pg\">p.145<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y2v9-p214-1\">→ After: Ryūen in the rain: conceding the loss, vowing the next<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hashimoto-masayoshi-y2v9-p148-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"sakayanagi-arisu hashimoto-masayoshi","q":"hashimoto masayoshi hashimoto  restless at sakayanagi s passivity at the cafe he tells sakayanagi and kamuro he is dissatisfied that class a is doing nothing compared with ryuen s harassment  suggests acting alone  but is talked down   sabotage wastes study time and his class can win as it is   hey  princess  are you sure we don t have to do anything this time  i don t   i m sorry  i overstepped the mark a bit  i ll go cool off  anxious and ambitious   jealous of ryuen s aggressive moves  he pushes for action but accepts sakayanagi s reasoning and apologizes for overstepping  his class leader  whose calm strategy he chafes under but ultimately respects","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hashimoto-masayoshi-y2v9-p148-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html#sc-hashimoto-masayoshi-y2v9-p148-1\">Hashimoto: restless at Sakayanagi&#x27;s passivity<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.148–151<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At the café he tells Sakayanagi and Kamuro he is dissatisfied that Class A is doing nothing compared with Ryūen&#x27;s harassment, suggests acting alone, but is talked down — sabotage wastes study time and his class can win as it is.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> &quot;Hey, Princess. Are you sure we don&#x27;t have to do anything this time? I don&#x27;t...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.148<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;m sorry, I overstepped the mark a bit. I&#x27;ll go cool off.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.151<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Anxious and ambitious — jealous of Ryūen&#x27;s aggressive moves, he pushes for action but accepts Sakayanagi&#x27;s reasoning and apologizes for overstepping.<span class=\"pg\">p.148–151<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> His class leader, whose calm strategy he chafes under but ultimately respects.<span class=\"pg\">p.148–151<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y2v9-p148-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"hashimoto-masayoshi ryuuen-kakeru sakayanagi-arisu","q":"sakayanagi arisu sakayanagi  calmly rejecting sabotage  expecting a fight at a cafe with hashimoto and kamuro  she explains why she will not copy ryuen s sabotage   it costs too much manpower and study time  and her class can win by studying   you seem to be very concerned about class b  hashimoto kun  she tells hashimoto she is a realist and a romantic   realistically class a should keep winning  but romantically an upset makes a better story   and prepares for a challenge from horikita or ryuen   it seems that you had been struggling a lot   i m a realist  but i m also a romantic  serene and strategic   she declines needless sabotage as inefficient  trusts her class s honest study  and balances pragmatism with a taste for dramatic upsets  her classmate whose sabotage ideas she talks down  refuses to imitate his harassment strategy","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y2v9-p148-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html#sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y2v9-p148-1\">Sakayanagi: calmly rejecting sabotage, expecting a fight<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.148–153<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At a café with Hashimoto and Kamuro, she explains why she will not copy Ryūen&#x27;s sabotage — it costs too much manpower and study time, and her class can win by studying. She tells Hashimoto she is a realist and a romantic — realistically Class A should keep winning, but romantically an upset makes a better story — and prepares for a challenge from Horikita or Ryūen.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> &quot;You seem to be very concerned about Class B, Hashimoto-kun.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.148<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> &quot;It seems that you had been struggling a lot.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.151<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;m a realist, but I&#x27;m also a romantic.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.151<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Serene and strategic — she declines needless sabotage as inefficient, trusts her class&#x27;s honest study, and balances pragmatism with a taste for dramatic upsets.<span class=\"pg\">p.148–153<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Her classmate whose sabotage ideas she talks down.<span class=\"pg\">p.148–151<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Refuses to imitate his harassment strategy.<span class=\"pg\">p.150<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y2v9-p199-1\">→ After: Sakayanagi&#x27;s ultimatum to Ichinose<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kamuro-masumi-y2v9-p149-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"","w":"sakayanagi-arisu kamuro-masumi","q":"kamuro masumi kamuro  curious about studying in public at the cafe with sakayanagi and hashimoto  she asks why they study in public places rather than the dorms  tearing a piece of bread  and nods as sakayanagi explains it helps her concentrate  an attentive  questioning classmate who listens to sakayanagi s reasoning about studying where interruptions occur  explains to her why studying in public aids concentration","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kamuro-masumi-y2v9-p149-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kamuro-masumi.html#sc-kamuro-masumi-y2v9-p149-1\">Kamuro: curious about studying in public<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.149<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kamuro-masumi.html\">Kamuro Masumi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At the café with Sakayanagi and Hashimoto, she asks why they study in public places rather than the dorms, tearing a piece of bread, and nods as Sakayanagi explains it helps her concentrate.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> An attentive, questioning classmate who listens to Sakayanagi&#x27;s reasoning about studying where interruptions occur.<span class=\"pg\">p.149<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Explains to her why studying in public aids concentration.<span class=\"pg\">p.149<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kitou-hayato-y2v9-p151-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"kitou-hayato","q":"kito hayato kito speaks in the cafe study session at the cafe study session  he throws a firm remark against hashimoto s suggestion   no  i understand what you re saying  princess  however  i m wary of class b  it s not a bad thing to think that they might catch up to us if we re not careful  is it  quiet but firm when he speaks","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kitou-hayato-y2v9-p151-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kitou-hayato.html#sc-kitou-hayato-y2v9-p151-1\">Kitō speaks in the café study session<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.151<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kitou-hayato.html\">Kitō Hayato<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At the café study session, he throws a firm remark against Hashimoto&#x27;s suggestion.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kitō Hayato<\/b> &quot;No, I understand what you&#x27;re saying, Princess. However… I&#x27;m wary of Class B. It&#x27;s not a bad thing to think that they might catch up to us if we&#x27;re not careful, is it?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.151<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Quiet but firm when he speaks.<span class=\"pg\">p.151<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v9-p152-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"sakayanagi-arisu kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru kaneda  underestimated as a  puppet  sakayanagi names him and says she can t trust him for free  he smiles wryly  adjusts his glasses  and accepts that it is natural to suspect he is ryuen s puppet  then works for himself   it s perfectly natural to suspect you of being ryuuen s puppet  you have   i work for myself  and you work for yourself  that s the best relationship  canny and self possessed   he erases the message he shows hashimoto and keeps his own counsel  refusing to be anyone s agent  she suspects him of being ryuen s puppet  he works independently","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v9-p152-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kaneda-satoru.html#sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v9-p152-1\">Kaneda: underestimated as a &quot;puppet&quot;<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.152<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kaneda-satoru.html\">Kaneda Satoru<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Sakayanagi names him and says she can&#x27;t trust him for free; he smiles wryly, adjusts his glasses, and accepts that it is natural to suspect he is Ryūen&#x27;s puppet, then works for himself.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kaneda Satoru<\/b> &quot;It&#x27;s perfectly natural to suspect you of being Ryuuen&#x27;s puppet. You have...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.152<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kaneda Satoru<\/b> &quot;I work for myself, and you work for yourself. That&#x27;s the best relationship.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.152<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Canny and self-possessed — he erases the message he shows Hashimoto and keeps his own counsel, refusing to be anyone&#x27;s agent.<span class=\"pg\">p.152<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> She suspects him of being Ryūen&#x27;s puppet; he works independently.<span class=\"pg\">p.152<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p153-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"","w":"kiriyama nagumo-miyabi kiryuin-fuuka asahina-nazuna ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka the shoplifting case  kiriyama exposed as the mastermind investigating kiryuin s complaint that nagumo ordered a first year  yamanaka  to shoplift  he gathers intel from third years   learns of nagumo s  contract  with lower classes  75  of private points to nagumo in exchange for class a tickets  and the anti nagumo faction  pieces together that kiriyama  nagumo s vp  was the real instigator   he ordered yamanaka tachibana to shoplift  blaming nagumo  to force kiryuin to complain to the student council  stop the election  and nagumo s 20m point bet  and make ichinose recall her  shoplifting  trauma and withdraw  his motive  prevent nagumo s  selfish  outflow of third year points and vote buying  he exposes him as the mastermind    kiriyama senpai s objective was to destroy the student council  election  he learns the details of nagumo s contract  75  of points  class a tickets    nagumo is  indirectly  the cause of much unrest  he warns her he can prove kiriyama s role    i m sure you could ve collected private points and redistributed them  she tells him about sachi  yamanaka s withdrawal and nagumo s contract    i d say it s more like a loophole","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p153-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p153-1\">The shoplifting case: Kiriyama exposed as the mastermind<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.153–169<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Investigating Kiryūin&#x27;s complaint that Nagumo ordered a first-year (Yamanaka) to shoplift, he gathers intel from third-years — learns of Nagumo&#x27;s &quot;contract&quot; with lower classes (75% of private points to Nagumo in exchange for Class A tickets) and the anti-Nagumo faction.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/kiriyama.html\">Kiriyama<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kiryuin-fuuka.html\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/asahina-nazuna.html\">Asahina Nazuna<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Pieces together that Kiriyama (Nagumo&#x27;s VP) was the real instigator — he ordered Yamanaka/Tachibana to shoplift (blaming Nagumo) to force Kiryūin to complain to the student council, stop the election (and Nagumo&#x27;s 20M-point bet), and make Ichinose recall her &quot;shoplifting&quot; trauma and withdraw; his motive: prevent Nagumo&#x27;s &quot;selfish&quot; outflow of third-year points and vote-buying.<span class=\"pg\">p.153–169<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama<\/b> He exposes him as the mastermind — &quot;Kiriyama-senpai&#x27;s objective was to destroy the student council [election].&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.166–169<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> He learns the details of Nagumo&#x27;s contract (75% of points, Class A tickets) — Nagumo is &quot;indirectly&quot; the cause of much unrest.<span class=\"pg\">p.160–169<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/b> He warns her he can prove Kiriyama&#x27;s role — &quot;I&#x27;m sure you could&#x27;ve collected private points and redistributed them...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.166–169<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Asahina Nazuna<\/b> She tells him about Sachi (Yamanaka)&#x27;s withdrawal and Nagumo&#x27;s contract — &quot;I&#x27;d say it&#x27;s more like a loophole.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.157–163<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p118-1\">← Before: The gym date with Ichinose; her changed feelings<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p170-1\">→ After: Ichinose visits his room: a &quot;selfish&quot; farewell to her feelings<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-asahina-nazuna-y2v9-p155-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka nagumo-miyabi asahina-nazuna","q":"asahina nazuna asahina  grieving moeka  and revealing nagumo s contract ayanokoji finds her in the staff room in tears over her friend moeka s withdrawal  she explains moeka quit over a serious violation and  indirectly  because of the environment nagumo created   this morning it was succhii  rather  moeka who quit school  suchi moeka from class c  over hot tea at a cafe she reveals the secret contract nagumo made with the lower third year classes   75  of private points to nagumo  obedience  tickets earned by recognized points  and a final lottery   which she can share because her bond with nagumo makes her a suspect  asked to help  she gives an objective read on yamanaka  below average  not outgoing  and agrees to contact her  she recalls seeing kiryuuin stomp a boy who was shielding yamanaka   it was anazai kun from class d  i think  when tachibana kento arrives and tries to stonewall  she is confused by his sudden appearance and tries to stop him from leaving after he refuses to be recorded   what  tachibana  yes  but  emotional over her friend s exit but clear eyed and trusting   she entrusts ayanokoji with nagumo s hidden contract and helps his investigation because  she says  she is curious about the truth too  trusts him enough to reveal the contract and contact yamanaka for him  close enough to him to be suspected of knowing his secrets  she resents his indifference to moeka s exit","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-asahina-nazuna-y2v9-p155-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/asahina-nazuna.html#sc-asahina-nazuna-y2v9-p155-1\">Asahina: grieving Moeka, and revealing Nagumo&#x27;s contract<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.155–169<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/asahina-nazuna.html\">Asahina Nazuna<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Ayanokōji finds her in the staff room in tears over her friend Moeka&#x27;s withdrawal; she explains Moeka quit over a serious violation and, indirectly, because of the environment Nagumo created. Over hot tea at a café she reveals the secret contract Nagumo made with the lower third-year classes — 75% of private points to Nagumo, obedience, tickets earned by recognized points, and a final lottery — which she can share because her bond with Nagumo makes her a suspect. Asked to help, she gives an objective read on Yamanaka (below average, not outgoing) and Agrees to contact her; she recalls seeing Kiryuuin stomp a boy who was shielding Yamanaka. When Tachibana Kento arrives and tries to stonewall, she is confused by his sudden appearance and tries to stop him from leaving after he refuses to be recorded.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Asahina Nazuna<\/b> &quot;This morning it was Succhii— Rather, Moeka who quit school. Suchi Moeka from Class C.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.157<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Asahina Nazuna<\/b> &quot;It was Anazai-kun from Class D, I think?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.165<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Asahina Nazuna<\/b> &quot;What? Tachibana? Yes, but…&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.166<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Emotional over her friend&#x27;s exit but clear-eyed and trusting — she entrusts Ayanokōji with Nagumo&#x27;s hidden contract and helps his investigation because, she says, she is curious about the truth too.<span class=\"pg\">p.155–169<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Trusts him enough to reveal the contract and contact Yamanaka for him.<span class=\"pg\">p.162–169<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Close enough to him to be suspected of knowing his secrets; she resents his indifference to Moeka&#x27;s exit.<span class=\"pg\">p.158–163<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p170-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami karuizawa-kei ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka ichinose visits his room  a  selfish  farewell to her feelings ichinose waits outside after school  asks to come to his room for  a little chat    a  selfish  request  she enters  notices kei s things  photo frame  drinks  and smiles   selfishness  did you mind   i m always leading a life of self indulgence  she asks him to sit beside her  her selfish wish  drinks cocoa  and   determined  not looking away   effectively gives voice to her feelings without confessing fully  he realizes she  didn t beg  and restrained herself from the act that would violate her morals    the core of ichinose honami    and that her change  bright  strong  will drive her class  he decides to support her from the side  she makes a  selfish  visit  sits close  and reveals her resolved feelings without crossing her moral line    she was able to restrain herself  kei s belongings photo are in the room   ichinose is aware of their relationship","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p170-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p170-1\">Ichinose visits his room: a &quot;selfish&quot; farewell to her feelings<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.170–176<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Ichinose waits outside after school, asks to come to his room for &quot;a little chat&quot; — a &quot;selfish&quot; request; she enters, notices Kei&#x27;s things (photo frame, drinks) and smiles.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;selfishness. Did you mind?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.173<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;m always leading a life of self-indulgence.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.174<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> She asks him to sit beside her (her selfish wish), drinks cocoa, and — determined, not looking away — effectively gives voice to her feelings without confessing fully; he realizes she &quot;didn&#x27;t beg&quot; and restrained herself from the act that would violate her morals — &quot;the core of Ichinose Honami&quot; — and that her change (bright, strong) will drive her class; he decides to support her from the side.<span class=\"pg\">p.170–176<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> She makes a &quot;selfish&quot; visit, sits close, and reveals her resolved feelings without crossing her moral line — &quot;she was able to restrain herself.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.170–176<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> Kei&#x27;s belongings/photo are in the room — Ichinose is aware of their relationship.<span class=\"pg\">p.172<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p153-1\">← Before: The shoplifting case: Kiriyama exposed as the mastermind<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p177-1\">→ After: The special exam; Horikita beats Sakayanagi<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p177-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"","w":"horikita-suzune sakayanagi-arisu karuizawa-kei ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka the special exam  horikita beats sakayanagi day of the collaborative written test vs class a  horikita submits the answering order   keisei leadoff  solves 2 quickly  reads the rest  then alternating high low students  students pass in the hallway and use hand signs to indicate which problem to solve  not against the rules    a clever exploitation of a loophole  notes the strategy  hand signals for problem numbers  lower ranked students solve easy problems  and koenji s unpredictability  if he refuses  only 4 pts lost  after the exam  class b wins   but their correct answer rate is 72  vs sakayanagi s 86   under identical conditions  horikita would have lost  sakayanagi accepts the loss with composure  her elaborate strategy wins    you used an interesting strategy for this special exam  she s frustrated only by the lower accuracy rate  not pessimistic  her class lost despite 86  accuracy    she would not be happy  she did what she had to do  and lost  their  cold war  continues   kei s morale  can easily affect the rest of our class  worries horikita  ayanokoji plans to  make up with her as soon as possible","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p177-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p177-1\">The special exam; Horikita beats Sakayanagi<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.177–198<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Day of the collaborative written test vs Class A; Horikita submits the answering order — Keisei leadoff (solves 2 quickly, reads the rest), then alternating high/low students; students pass in the hallway and use hand signs to indicate which problem to solve (not against the rules) — a clever exploitation of a loophole.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Notes the strategy (hand signals for problem numbers; lower-ranked students solve easy problems) and Kōenji&#x27;s unpredictability (if he refuses, only 4 pts lost); after the exam, Class B wins — but their correct-answer rate is 72% vs Sakayanagi&#x27;s 86% (under identical conditions, Horikita would have lost); Sakayanagi accepts the loss with composure.<span class=\"pg\">p.177–198<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Her elaborate strategy wins — &quot;You used an interesting strategy for this special exam&quot;; she&#x27;s frustrated only by the lower accuracy rate, not pessimistic.<span class=\"pg\">p.177–198<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Her class lost despite 86% accuracy — &quot;She would not be happy. She did what she had to do, and lost.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.197<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> Their &quot;cold war&quot; continues — Kei&#x27;s morale (can easily affect the rest of our class) worries Horikita; Ayanokōji plans to &quot;make up with her as soon as possible.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.195–198<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p170-1\">← Before: Ichinose visits his room: a &quot;selfish&quot; farewell to her feelings<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p183-1\">→ After: The student council hearing; Horikita judges Kiriyama<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9-p177-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka karuizawa-kei","q":"karuizawa kei kei   it s about time i forgave you  after the special exam she tells ayanokoji  hesitantly  that it is about time she forgave him  a student council matter with horikita and kushida cuts their conversation short   well  i think it s about time for me to forgive you  softening after their fight   she is ready to make up but the moment is interrupted  signals willingness to reconcile","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9-p177-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html#sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9-p177-1\">Kei: &quot;it&#x27;s about time I forgave you&quot;<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.177–180<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">After the special exam she tells Ayanokōji, hesitantly, that it is about time she forgave him; a student-council matter with Horikita and Kushida cuts their conversation short.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;Well, I think it&#x27;s about time for me to forgive you…&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.177<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Softening after their fight — she is ready to make up but the moment is interrupted.<span class=\"pg\">p.177–180<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Signals willingness to reconcile.<span class=\"pg\">p.177<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9-p8-1\">← Before: Kei: bedhead in the morning, sulking at the study group<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9-p203-1\">→ After: Kei&#x27;s &quot;relationship trouble&quot;: confiding in Satō<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v9-p177-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"","w":"horikita-suzune kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke koenji  the unpredictable last solver in the exam on the morning of the special exam he is  as usual  utterly relaxed   browsing the internet with a hand mirror while others study hard  horikita  unsure whether he will take it seriously  places him last in the order so that 98 of 100 questions are already filled in before his turn  he replies only that he has the right to do whatever he wants  free and unpredictable   his refusal to commit to seriousness forces horikita to design the order around him  giving him the final  safest slot  she works around his unpredictability by putting him last","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v9-p177-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kouenji-rokusuke.html#sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v9-p177-1\">Kōenji: the unpredictable last solver in the exam<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.177–180<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kouenji-rokusuke.html\">Kōenji Rokusuke<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">On the morning of the special exam he is, as usual, utterly relaxed — browsing the internet with a hand mirror while others study hard; Horikita, unsure whether he will take it seriously, places him last in the order so that 98 of 100 questions are already filled in before his turn.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> He replies only that he has the right to do whatever he wants.<span class=\"pg\">p.178<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Free and unpredictable — his refusal to commit to seriousness forces Horikita to design the order around him, giving him the final, safest slot.<span class=\"pg\">p.177–180<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> She works around his unpredictability by putting him last.<span class=\"pg\">p.178<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9-p180-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"kiriyama-ikuto nagumo-miyabi kiryuin-fuuka","q":"kiryuin fuuka kiryuin  the shoplifting complaint and her demand for an apology in the hearing she files a complaint over the attempt to frame her as a shoplifter  revealing that the third year yamanaka confessed she had been instructed   and naming nagumo as the alleged orderer   sorry to keep you waiting  new student council president   i just can t believe yamanaka acted out of personal resentment  she presses nagumo  spars with kiriyama  and rejects a quiet cover up  when kiriyama finally confesses he used her as the target  her sole demand is an apology from the real culprit   all i want is an apology from the real culprit  direct and principled   she refuses to let the matter be buried  wants the truth rather than a convenient story  and cares about the apology more than punishment  her classmate whom she suspected  he confesses he framed her deliberately  she names him as the one who allegedly ordered the framing  he denies it","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9-p180-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kiryuin-fuuka.html#sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9-p180-1\">Kiryūin: the shoplifting complaint and her demand for an apology<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.180–190<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kiryuin-fuuka.html\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">In the hearing she files a complaint over the attempt to frame her as a shoplifter, revealing that the third-year Yamanaka confessed she had been instructed — and naming Nagumo as the alleged orderer. She presses Nagumo, spars with Kiriyama, and rejects a quiet cover-up; when Kiriyama finally confesses he used her as the target, her sole demand is an apology from the real culprit.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/kiriyama-ikuto.html\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/b> &quot;Sorry to keep you waiting, new student council president.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.183<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/b> &quot;I just can&#x27;t believe Yamanaka acted out of personal resentment.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.184<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/b> &quot;All I want is an apology from the real culprit.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.186<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Direct and principled — she refuses to let the matter be buried, wants the truth rather than a convenient story, and cares about the apology more than punishment.<span class=\"pg\">p.180–190<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/b> Her classmate whom she suspected; he confesses he framed her deliberately.<span class=\"pg\">p.189–190<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> She names him as the one who allegedly ordered the framing; he denies it.<span class=\"pg\">p.184<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9-p76-1\">← Before: Kiryūin recruits Ayanokōji to investigate<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p183-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune kiriyama kushida-kikyou nanase-tsubasa ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka the student council hearing  horikita judges kiriyama after the exam  the new student council  horikita president  kushida vp  nanase agasaka first years  convenes with kiryuin  nagumo  kiriyama   horikita presides   the real person behind this case is not nagumo senpai  but kiriyamasenpai  the vice president    horikita watches as horikita  prompted by his report  unravels the case  kiriyama framed yamanaka tachibana to blame nagumo and stop the election  kiriyama admits it  his  betrayal  of nagumo to prevent  unnecessary  point outflows  horikita s judgment   kiriyama sincerely apologizes to kiryuin and voluntarily suspends himself for a week  nagumo must not revoke his class a ticket  and third year collected points may only be used for third years   is accepted by all  even nagumo  you have the power to undermine me  he notes kiriyama s  meaningful expression  at the end    i don t know if this is really the end  her first case as president   she judges fairly and firmly   a much more capable student council president than i thought  he s exposed  admits it    it is an action based on a contract  do whatever you want  now student council vice president    i guess you chose kushida as the vice president after all  she takes the meeting notes as a new first year council member","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p183-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p183-1\">The student council hearing; Horikita judges Kiriyama<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.183–194<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">After the exam, the new student council (Horikita president, Kushida VP, Nanase/Agasaka first-years) convenes with Kiryūin, Nagumo, Kiriyama — Horikita presides.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kiriyama.html\">Kiriyama<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kushida-kikyou.html\">Kushida Kikyō<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nanase-tsubasa.html\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;The real person behind this case is not Nagumo-senpai, but Kiriyamasenpai, the vice president.&quot; — Horikita<span class=\"pg\">p.188<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Watches as Horikita (prompted by his report) unravels the case: Kiriyama framed Yamanaka/Tachibana to blame Nagumo and stop the election; Kiriyama admits it (his &quot;betrayal&quot; of Nagumo to prevent &quot;unnecessary&quot; point outflows); Horikita&#x27;s judgment — Kiriyama sincerely apologizes to Kiryūin and voluntarily suspends himself for a week, Nagumo must not revoke his Class A ticket, and third-year-collected points may only be used for third-years — is accepted by all, even Nagumo (&quot;You have the power to undermine me&quot;); he notes Kiriyama&#x27;s &quot;meaningful expression&quot; at the end — &quot;I don&#x27;t know if this is really the end.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.183–194<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Her first case as president — she judges fairly and firmly, &quot;a much more capable student council president than I thought.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.183–194<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama<\/b> He&#x27;s exposed, admits it — &quot;It is an action based on a contract. Do whatever you want.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.188–194<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> Now student council vice president — &quot;I guess you chose Kushida as the vice president after all.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.183<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/b> She takes the meeting notes as a new first-year council member.<span class=\"pg\">p.181–190<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p177-1\">← Before: The special exam; Horikita beats Sakayanagi<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p199-1\">→ After: Sakayanagi&#x27;s ultimatum to Ichinose; a quiet warning<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-housen-kazuomi-y2v9-p185-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"","w":"housen-kazuomi","q":"hosen kazuomi housen mentioned in passing named in sakayanagi s ultimatum scene    why don t you invite someone like housen kun  passing mention  not a scene presence","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-housen-kazuomi-y2v9-p185-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/housen-kazuomi.html#sc-housen-kazuomi-y2v9-p185-1\">Housen mentioned in passing<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.185<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/housen-kazuomi.html\">Hōsen Kazuomi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in Sakayanagi&#x27;s ultimatum scene — &quot;Why don&#x27;t you invite someone like Housen-kun?&quot;<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mention; not a scene presence.<span class=\"pg\">p.185<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p199-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"sakayanagi-arisu ichinose-honami ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka sakayanagi s ultimatum to ichinose  a quiet warning after the results  meets sakayanagi  who summoned him  and ichinose  who also messaged  outside  sakayanagi congratulates them and reveals her  ultimatum  for ichinose   distance herself from ayanokoji  you are being controlled by him   i have called you both here today to tell you that i am here to give an ultimatum to ichinose san  who has a faint crush on ayanokouji kun   you should distance yourself from ayanokouji kun now  watches as ichinose   changed   cold look in her eyes    rejects the ultimatum  accusing sakayanagi of wanting to control her and being conscious of ayanokoji as a special person  sakayanagi is briefly caught off guard  a rare upset  and concedes  afterward she tells ayanokoji she never thought she would be re evaluating ichinose  and reveals she has no intention of stopping ichinose   the only difference is who destroys her   planning to visit his room again  she gives ichinose an ultimatum and shows her hand  i will visit your room again in the near future  she sees ichinose as a  consumable  pawn  she rejects sakayanagi s ultimatum   her good directed outward  completely transformed into evil  ayanokoji realizes love can influence our reason and nature   an unpredictable force","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p199-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p199-1\">Sakayanagi&#x27;s ultimatum to Ichinose; a quiet warning<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.199–202<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">After the results, meets Sakayanagi (who summoned him) and Ichinose (who also messaged) outside; Sakayanagi congratulates them and reveals her &quot;ultimatum&quot; for Ichinose — distance herself from Ayanokōji (&quot;you are being controlled by him&quot;).<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;I have called you both here today to tell you that I am here to give an ultimatum to Ichinose-san, who has a faint crush on Ayanokouji-kun.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.200<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;You should distance yourself from Ayanokouji-kun now.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.201<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Watches as Ichinose — changed, &quot;cold look in her eyes&quot; — rejects the ultimatum, accusing Sakayanagi of wanting to control her and being conscious of Ayanokōji as a special person; Sakayanagi is briefly caught off guard (a rare upset) and concedes; afterward she tells Ayanokōji she never thought she would be re-evaluating Ichinose, and reveals she has no intention of stopping Ichinose — the only difference is who destroys her — planning to visit his room again.<span class=\"pg\">p.199–202<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> She gives Ichinose an ultimatum and shows her hand (&quot;I will visit your room again in the near future&quot;); she sees Ichinose as a &quot;consumable&quot; pawn.<span class=\"pg\">p.199–202<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> She rejects Sakayanagi&#x27;s ultimatum — her good directed outward, completely transformed into evil; Ayanokōji realizes love can influence our reason and nature — an unpredictable force.<span class=\"pg\">p.200–202<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9-p183-1\">← Before: The student council hearing; Horikita judges Kiriyama<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y2v9-p199-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami ayanokouji-kiyotaka sakayanagi-arisu","q":"sakayanagi arisu sakayanagi s ultimatum to ichinose at the school entrance after the results she calls ayanokoji and ichinose together  congratulates them on their wins and praises ichinose for withstanding ryuen s obstruction   first of all  ayanokouji kun  congratulations on your victory in this special examination  she reveals she has pieced together ichinose s recent meetings with ayanokoji  the gym  cafes  the day she waited at his room  and issues an ultimatum  too much idolisation can bring painful repercussions  and she warns ichinose about her  faint crush   too much idolisation may result in painful repercussions  wasn t it something like that   i have called you both here today to tell you that i am here to give an ultimatum to ichinose san  who has a faint crush on ayanokouji kun  composed and observant   she has read ichinose s feelings and the pattern of her contacts with ayanokoji  and delivers her warning calmly rather than spitefully  warns her that her idolisation of ayanokoji will bring pain  congratulates him and notes his win was one he was  allowed to pick up","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y2v9-p199-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html#sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y2v9-p199-1\">Sakayanagi&#x27;s ultimatum to Ichinose<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.199–202<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At the school entrance after the results she calls Ayanokōji and Ichinose together, congratulates them on their wins and praises Ichinose for withstanding Ryūen&#x27;s obstruction. She reveals she has pieced together Ichinose&#x27;s recent meetings with Ayanokōji (the gym, cafés, the day she waited at his room) and issues an ultimatum: too much idolisation can bring painful repercussions, and she warns Ichinose about her &quot;faint crush.&quot;<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> &quot;First of all, Ayanokouji-kun, congratulations on your victory in this special examination.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.199<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> &quot;Too much idolisation may result in painful repercussions. Wasn&#x27;t it something like that?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.200<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> &quot;I have called you both here today to tell you that I am here to give an ultimatum to Ichinose-san, who has a faint crush on Ayanokouji-kun.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.200<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Composed and observant — she has read Ichinose&#x27;s feelings and the pattern of her contacts with Ayanokōji, and delivers her warning calmly rather than spitefully.<span class=\"pg\">p.199–202<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Warns her that her idolisation of Ayanokōji will bring pain.<span class=\"pg\">p.200–202<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Congratulates him and notes his win was one he was &quot;allowed to pick up.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.199–202<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y2v9-p148-1\">← Before: Sakayanagi: calmly rejecting sabotage, expecting a fight<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9-p203-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka satou-maya karuizawa-kei","q":"karuizawa kei kei s  relationship trouble  confiding in sato the only student not celebrating the exam win   sat with sato at keyaki mall  sighing repeatedly  she s been  suffering  through the  cold war  with ayanokoji while keeping up appearances at school   i think my relationship with kiyotaka might be in trouble   i d like to think that s not true  but  i can t help but feel that way lately   i focused on my studies that kiyotaka told me to work hard on  and i answered 3 out of 4 questions correctly on the exam  i thought i could do this  she reveals to sato that she and ayanokoji have been distant  a cold war  after a fight she started  i was the one who got angry  despite studying hard  3 4 correct  and trying to approach him after the exam  nagumo and horikita kept calling him away   she s uncertain whether he s angry or sulking  he s always expressionless  her relationship with him is in trouble  might be in trouble    a  cold war  she can t read  she confides in her best friend  who had been waiting for it    sato advises  aren t there a lot of fights in relationships","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9-p203-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html#sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9-p203-1\">Kei&#x27;s &quot;relationship trouble&quot;: confiding in Satō<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.203–205<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">The only student not celebrating the exam win — sat with Satō at Keyaki Mall, sighing repeatedly; she&#x27;s been &quot;suffering&quot; through the &quot;cold war&quot; with Ayanokōji while keeping up appearances at school.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/satou-maya.html\">Satō Maya<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;I think my relationship with Kiyotaka might be in trouble...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.204<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;d like to think that&#x27;s not true, but... I can&#x27;t help but feel that way lately.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.204<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;I focused on my studies that Kiyotaka told me to work hard on, and I answered 3 out of 4 questions correctly on the exam. I thought I could do this.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.205<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> She reveals to Satō that she and Ayanokōji have been distant (&quot;a cold war&quot;) after a fight she started (&quot;I was the one who got angry&quot;); despite studying hard (3/4 correct) and trying to approach him after the exam, Nagumo and Horikita kept calling him away — she&#x27;s uncertain whether he&#x27;s angry or sulking (&quot;He&#x27;s always expressionless&quot;).<span class=\"pg\">p.203–205<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Her relationship with him is in trouble (&quot;might be in trouble&quot;) — a &quot;cold war&quot; she can&#x27;t read.<span class=\"pg\">p.203–205<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Satō Maya<\/b> She confides in her best friend (who had been waiting for it) — Satō advises &quot;aren&#x27;t there a lot of fights in relationships?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.203–205<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9-p177-1\">← Before: Kei: &quot;it&#x27;s about time I forgave you&quot;<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9-p208-1\">→ After: Kei: the gym photo and Ichinose confrontation<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-satou-maya-y2v9-p204-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"karuizawa-kei ichinose-honami satou-maya","q":"sato maya sato  counseling kei through her  relationship trouble  at keyaki mall she listens as kei confides that her relationship with ayanokoji may be in trouble after a fight  and offers her blunt  pure girl verdict that he was at fault   does  relationship trouble  mean  that you might break up   i see  it s definitely ayanokouji kun s fault  when kei sees a photo of ayanokoji with ichinose at the gym  sato tries to console her  then questions ichinose directly  she is reassured when ichinose denies anything between them   does ayanokouji kun go to the gym  a loyal  emotionally direct best friend   eagerly hears kei out  takes her side without bias  and confronts ichinose to defend her friend  kei s confidante  she had been waiting for kei to open up and supports her  questions her closely about the gym photo and the alleged date","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-satou-maya-y2v9-p204-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/satou-maya.html#sc-satou-maya-y2v9-p204-1\">Satō: counseling Kei through her &quot;relationship trouble&quot;<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.204–211<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/satou-maya.html\">Satō Maya<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At Keyaki Mall she listens as Kei confides that her relationship with Ayanokōji may be in trouble after a fight, and offers her blunt, pure-girl verdict that he was at fault. When Kei sees a photo of Ayanokōji with Ichinose at the gym, Satō tries to console her, then questions Ichinose directly; she is reassured when Ichinose denies anything between them.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Satō Maya<\/b> &quot;Does &#x27;relationship trouble&#x27; mean... that you might break up?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.204<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Satō Maya<\/b> &quot;I see... it&#x27;s definitely Ayanokouji-kun&#x27;s fault!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.206<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Satō Maya<\/b> &quot;Does Ayanokouji-kun go to the gym?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.209<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> A loyal, emotionally direct best friend — eagerly hears Kei out, takes her side without bias, and confronts Ichinose to defend her friend.<span class=\"pg\">p.204–211<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> Kei&#x27;s confidante; she had been waiting for Kei to open up and supports her.<span class=\"pg\">p.204–211<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Questions her closely about the gym photo and the alleged date.<span class=\"pg\">p.209–211<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9-p208-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"","w":"satou-maya ichinose-honami karuizawa-kei","q":"karuizawa kei kei  the gym photo and ichinose confrontation shown a photo from mori of ayanokoji and ichinose leaving the gym together  she freezes  asks when it was taken  and tries to downplay it  sato backs up her cover  they run into ichinose at the gym  sato presses her  and kei tries to stop her while ichinose calmly denies anything between her and ayanokoji   which only unsettles kei more  not yet  jealous and insecure   the photo and ichinose s composure feed her fear that ayanokoji may switch to someone else  despite ichinose s denial  helps cover for her and confronts ichinose on her behalf  suspects her of getting close to ayanokoji  ichinose denies it","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9-p208-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html#sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9-p208-1\">Kei: the gym photo and Ichinose confrontation<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.208–211<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Shown a photo from Mori of Ayanokōji and Ichinose leaving the gym together, she freezes, asks when it was taken, and tries to downplay it; Satō backs up her cover. They run into Ichinose at the gym; Satō presses her, and Kei tries to stop her while Ichinose calmly denies anything between her and Ayanokōji — which only unsettles Kei more (&quot;Not yet&quot;).<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/satou-maya.html\">Satō Maya<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Jealous and insecure — the photo and Ichinose&#x27;s composure feed her fear that Ayanokōji may switch to someone else, despite Ichinose&#x27;s denial.<span class=\"pg\">p.208–211<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Satō Maya<\/b> Helps cover for her and confronts Ichinose on her behalf.<span class=\"pg\">p.208–211<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Suspects her of getting close to Ayanokōji; Ichinose denies it.<span class=\"pg\">p.209–211<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9-p203-1\">← Before: Kei&#x27;s &quot;relationship trouble&quot;: confiding in Satō<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mori-nene-y2v9-p208-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"","w":"mori-nene","q":"mori nene mori  the gym photo that sparks kei s suspicion mentioned only   kei receives a photo from  nene chan  showing ayanokoji and ichinose leaving the gym together  when sato asks  kei confirms it came from mori and checks when it was taken","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mori-nene-y2v9-p208-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/mori-nene.html#sc-mori-nene-y2v9-p208-1\">Mori: the gym photo that sparks Kei&#x27;s suspicion<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.208–209<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/mori-nene.html\">Mori Nene<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Mentioned only — Kei receives a photo from &quot;Nene-chan&quot; showing Ayanokōji and Ichinose leaving the gym together; when Satō asks, Kei confirms it came from Mori and checks when it was taken.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9-p213-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ryuuen-kakeru ichinose-honami","q":"ichinose honami ichinose   not yet  and the rain talk with ryuen after kei and sato walk away  she quietly mutters to herself that things with ayanokoji are  not yet  resolved  and leaves   not yet  you know  on the first day of winter break she meets ryuen in the pouring rain  she reveals she waited ready to leave after 30 minutes  defends her class s honest studying against his sabotage  and says his underhanded strategy was a mistake   i was prepared to wait for 30 minutes  if you didn t show up by then  i was going to leave without hesitation   you re such a softy for taking the trouble to answer my call   there is no wisdom in there  ryuuen kun  we just continued to study in the midst of the noise  quietly resolute   she has not given up on ayanokoji  not yet  and calmly stands her ground against ryuen  crediting her class s growth rather than any trick  meets him in the rain  defends her class s win and tells him his sabotage was a mistake","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9-p213-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html#sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9-p213-1\">Ichinose: &quot;not yet,&quot; and the rain talk with Ryūen<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.213–217<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">After Kei and Satō walk away, she quietly mutters to herself that things with Ayanokōji are &quot;not yet&quot; resolved, and leaves. On the first day of winter break she meets Ryūen in the pouring rain; she reveals she waited ready to leave after 30 minutes, defends her class&#x27;s honest studying against his sabotage, and says his underhanded strategy was a mistake.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;Not yet, you know...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.213<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;I was prepared to wait for 30 minutes. If you didn&#x27;t show up by then, I was going to leave without hesitation.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.214<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;You&#x27;re such a softy for taking the trouble to answer my call.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.214<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;There is no wisdom in there, Ryuuen-kun. We just continued to study in the midst of the noise.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.215<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Quietly resolute — she has not given up on Ayanokōji (&quot;not yet&quot;), and calmly stands her ground against Ryūen, crediting her class&#x27;s growth rather than any trick.<span class=\"pg\">p.213–217<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Meets him in the rain; defends her class&#x27;s win and tells him his sabotage was a mistake.<span class=\"pg\">p.214–217<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9-p144-1\">← Before: Ichinose withstands Ryūen&#x27;s provocation<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y2v9-p214-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami ryuuen-kakeru","q":"ryuen kakeru ryuen in the rain  conceding the loss  vowing the next meeting ichinose in the rain  he admits his class lost because they never took studying seriously  but refuses to change his methods and promises to sink her class next time   not going to complain about the delay   but did you really think you could win that way   i m not going to change  i m going to sink you on the spot  a sore but self aware loser   he acknowledges earnest study beat him  yet stubbornly refuses to abandon his aggressive style  concedes she won this time and warns her class c seat is temporary","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y2v9-p214-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html#sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y2v9-p214-1\">Ryūen in the rain: conceding the loss, vowing the next<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.214–217<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Meeting Ichinose in the rain, he admits his class lost because they never took studying seriously, but refuses to change his methods and promises to sink her class next time.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> &quot;Not going to complain about the delay?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.214<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> &quot;But did you really think you could win that way?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.215<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;m not going to change. I&#x27;m going to sink you on the spot.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.216<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> A sore but self-aware loser — he acknowledges earnest study beat him, yet stubbornly refuses to abandon his aggressive style.<span class=\"pg\">p.214–217<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Concedes she won this time and warns her Class C seat is temporary.<span class=\"pg\">p.214–217<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y2v9-p144-1\">← Before: Ryūen: provoking Ichinose&#x27;s class over her council exit<\/button><\/div><\/article>"}];
